  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Configuring Style and Font Families**\n\nI\'ve just finished configuring the `/src/index.css` file. I\'ve set up the font families using `Outfit` for display, `Plus Jakarta Sans` for sans-serif, and `JetBrains Mono` for mono. Additionally, I\'ve created the custom keyframe animations necessary for the horizontal marquee effect and the stroke utility classes that pair with it.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_411823"
      name: "replace_file_content"
      arguments_json: "{\"AllowMultiple\":false, \"Description\":\"Configure typography, marquee animations, and outlined stroke utilities in src/index.css\", \"EndLine\":2, \"Instruction\":\"Add @theme font definitions, marquee keyframes, and stroke text styles to src/index.css\", \"ReplacementContent\":\"@import \\\"tailwindcss\\\";\\n\\n@theme {\\n  --font-display: \\\"Outfit\\\", sans-serif;\\n  --font-sans: \\\"Plus Jakarta Sans\\\", sans-serif;\\n  --font-mono: \\\"JetBrains Mono\\\", monospace;\\n}\\n\\n@keyframes marquee-left {\\n  0% {\\n    transform: translate3d(0%, 0, 0);\\n  }\\n  100% {\\n    transform: translate3d(-50%, 0, 0);\\n  }\\n}\\n\\n@keyframes marquee-right {\\n  0% {\\n    transform: translate3d(-50%, 0, 0);\\n  }\\n  100% {\\n    transform: translate3d(0%, 0, 0);\\n  }\\n}\\n\\n.animate-marquee-left {\\n  display: flex;\\n  width: max-content;\\n  animation: marquee-left var(--marquee-duration, 26s) linear infinite;\\n  will-change: transform;\\n}\\n\\n.animate-marquee-right {\\n  display: flex;\\n  width: max-content;\\n  animation: marquee-right var(--marquee-duration, 32s) linear infinite;\\n  will-change: transform;\\n}\\n\\n.marquee-paused {\\n  animation-play-state: paused !important;\\n}\\n\\n/* Outlined display typography matching reference image.png */\\n.stroke-text-light {\\n  color: transparent;\\n  -webkit-text-stroke: 2px rgba(20, 20, 22, 0.82);\\n}\\n\\n.stroke-text-light-overlay {\\n  color: transparent;\\n  -webkit-text-stroke: 1.5px rgba(20, 20, 22, 0.55);\\n}\\n\\n.stroke-text-dark {\\n  color: transparent;\\n  -webkit-text-stroke: 2px rgba(244, 244, 245, 0.78);\\n}\\n\\n.stroke-text-dark-overlay {\\n  color: transparent;\\n  -webkit-text-stroke: 1.5px rgba(244, 244, 245, 0.45);\\n}\\n\\n@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {\\n  .animate-marquee-left,\\n  .animate-marquee-right {\\n    animation-duration: 60s;\\n  }\\n}\\n\", \"StartLine\":1, \"TargetContent\":\"@import \\\"tailwindcss\\\";\\n\", \"TargetFile\":\"/src