  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Crafting UI Components Precisely**\n\nI\'m now fully immersed in building modular UI components. I\'m prioritizing extreme precision, ensuring these components align perfectly with the reference layout (image_66361083.png), Mahesa\'s portrait (porto_31e92968.png), the user\'s explicit needs, and the `frontend-design` guidelines. I\'m focusing on user needs and how to best address them.\n\n\n**Designing Navigation Bar**\n\nI\'ve moved on to designing the navigation bar. It\'ll be fixed at the top, a glassmorphism container that is always present across pages. I\'m focusing on its layout now, thinking about the glass effect and hover animations. It\'ll have my name on the left and navigation menu items (About, Experience, etc.) on the right.\n\n\n**Refining Navigation Bar Style**\n\nI\'m now zeroing in on the finer details of the navigation bar\'s visual style. Specifically, I\'m defining the light and dark mode variations for the glassmorphism effect, ensuring it blends seamlessly with the page\'s overall aesthetic. I am also implementing hover animations for the branding and menu items, focusing on smooth transitions and visual cues for the user. I\'ve designed a sleek monogram badge for the brand name. The links will also have a glass highlight backdrop and an animated hairline bar on hover or when active.\n\n\n**Implementing Navbar Functionality**\n\nI\'m now implementing the theme switch and contact CTA buttons within the right zone of the navigation bar. The theme switch will toggle between \"Editorial Light Monochrome\" and \"Noir Dark Monochrome\" styles. The primary CTA will be a \"Contact Me\" button with specific styling and hover effects. I\'m also adding a mobile menu button for smaller viewports. I\'m aiming for a sleek design matching the image reference.\n\n\n**Constructing Hero Section**\n\nI\'m now building the hero section. I\'ve centered Mahesa\'s portrait and added a marquee that scrolls across the viewport. The marquee displays \"PORTOFOLIO\" repeatedly in large, bold uppercase text. I\'ve focused on using a dark background (`#0A0A0B` in Dark Mode) and ensuring smooth animation for the text. I\'m carefully layering the text with an outlined stroke for visual depth, behind the portrait.\n\n\n**Refining Portrait Display**\n\nI\'m now determining the best way to present Mahesa\'s portrait in the hero section. Considering the user\'s monochrome theme preference, I\'m leaning toward a default \"Monochrome Studio\" filter for the image. However, I\'m also planning to incorporate a toggle feature so the user can switch between the \"Monochrome B&W Portrait\" and the \"Original Portrait\" views with ease. I\'m focusing on preserving an elegant feel, inspired by `image.png`\'s approach of natural skin tones against a monochrome backdrop.\n\n\n**Deciding Portrait Style**\n\nI\'m now determining the default portrait style. I\'m choosing between \"Monochrome Studio\" and \"Natural Tone,\" aiming for a refined look. I\'ve designed a switch in the bottom-left utility bar for switching between the styles. I plan to add a hairline stroke layer, similar to `image.png`, to the giant `PORTOFOLIO` text in the background to add depth to Mahesa\'s portrait. I\'m focusing on ensuring Mahesa\'s face remains clear and unobstructed.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_582488"
      name: "write_to_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"CodeContent\":\"import React, { useState } from \'react\';\\nimport { Menu, Moon, Sun, X } from \'lucide-react\';\\nimport { NAV_ITEMS, type NavSectionId } from \'../data/portfolioData\';\\n\\ninterface NavbarProps {\\n  activeSection: NavSectionId;\\n  onNavigate: (sectionId: NavSectionId) => void;\\n  darkMode: boolean;\\n  onToggleDarkMode: () => void;\\n}\\n\\nexport const Navbar: React.FC<NavbarProps> = ({\\n  activeSection,\\n  onNavigate,\\n  darkMode,\\n  onToggleDarkMode,\\n}) => {\\n  const [hoveredId, setHoveredId] = useState<NavSectionId | null>(null);\\n  const [mobileMenuOpen, setMobileMenuOpen] = useState(false);\\n\\n  const brandItem = NAV_ITEMS.find((item) => item.isBrand)!;\\n  const centerItems = NAV_ITEMS.filter((item) => !item.isBrand && !item.isCta);\\n  const ctaItem = NAV_ITEMS.find((item) => item.isCta)!;\\n\\n  const handleNavClick = (\\n    e: React.MouseEvent<HTMLAnchorElement>,\\n    id: NavSectionId\\n  ) => {\\n    e.preventDefault();\\n    onNavigate(id);\\n    setMobileMenuOpen(false);\\n  };\\n\\n  return (\\n    <header className=\\\"fixed top-4 sm:top-6 inset-x-0 z-50 px-4 sm:px-8 pointer-events-none\\\">\\n      <div\\n        className={`max-w-[1160px] mx-auto pointer-events-auto rounded-2xl backdrop-blur-xl border transition-all duration-300 px-4 sm:px-6 py-3 flex items-center justify-between gap-4 sm:gap-8 ${\\n          darkMode\\n            ? \'bg-zinc-900/75 border-white/15 text-zinc-100 shadow-[0_12px_40px_rgba(0,0,0,0.55)]\'\\n            : \'bg-white/75 border-zinc-900/10 text-zinc-900 shadow-[0_10px_35px_rgba(0,0,0,0.06)]\'\\n        }`}\\n      >\\n        {/* Zone 1: Brand (Mahesa) */}\\n        <a\\n          href={`#${brandItem.id}`}\\n          onClick={(e) => handleNavClick(e, brandItem.id)}\\n          className=\\\"group flex items-center gap-3 whitespace-nowrap shrink-0 focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-4\\\"\\n          aria-label=\\\"Mahesa \342\200\224 Kembali ke Beranda\\\"\\n        >\\n          <span\\n            className={`w-9 h-9 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center font-serif italic font-bold text-base transition-transform duration-200 group-hover:scale-105 ${\\n              darkMode\\n                ? \'bg-zinc-100 text-zinc-950 shadow-sm\'\\n                : \'bg-zinc-950 text-white shadow-sm\'\\n            }`}\\n          >\\n            M\\n          </span>\\n          <span className=\\\"font-display font-bold text-sm sm:text-base tracking-[0.18em] uppercase transition-opacity duration-200 group-hover:opacity-80\\\">\\n            {brandItem.label}\\n          </span>\\n        </a>\\n\\n        {/* Zone 2: Center Navigation Links (About - Experience - Competencies - Certification - Projects) */}\\n        <nav\\n          aria-label=\\\"Navigasi Utama Portofolio\\\"\\n          className=\\\"hidden lg:flex items-center gap-1 xl:gap-2\\\"\\n          onMouseLeave={() => setHoveredId(null)}\\n        >\\n          {centerItems.map((item) => {\\n            const isActive = activeSection === item.id;\\n            const isHovered = hoveredId === item.id;\\n\\n            return (\\n              <a\\n                key={item.id}\\n                href={`#${item.id}`}\\n                onClick={(e) => handleNavClick(e, item.id)}\\n                onMouseEnter={() => setHoveredId(item.id)}\\n                className={`relative px-3.5 py-2 rounded-xl text-xs xl:text-[13px] font-medium tracking-[0.12em] uppercase whitespace-nowrap shrink-0 transition-all duration-200 ${\\n                  isActive\\n                    ? darkMode\\n                      ? \'text-white font-semibold\'\\n                      : \'text-zinc-950 font-semibold\'\\n                    : darkMode\\n                      ? \'text-zinc-400 hover:text-zinc-100\'\\n                      : \'text-zinc-600 hover:text-zinc-950\'\\n                }`}\\n              >\\n                {/* Glass Hover Pill Indicator */}\\n                <span\\n                  aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"\\n                  className={`absolute inset-0 rounded-xl transition-all duration-200 ${\\n                    isHovered\\n                      ? darkMode\\n                        ? \'bg-white/10 opacity-100 scale-100\'\\n                        : \'bg-zinc-900/[0.06] opacity-100 scale-100\'\\n                      : isActive\\n                        ? darkMode\\n                          ? \'bg-white/[0.06] opacity-100 scale-100\'\\n                          : \'bg-zinc-900/[0.04] opacity-100 scale-100\'\\n                        : \'opacity-0 scale-95\'\\n                  }`}\\n                />\\n\\n                {/* Menu Text */}\\n                <span className=\\\"relative z-10 inline-block transition-transform duration-200\\\">\\n                  {item.label}\\n                </span>\\n\\n                {/* Smooth Bottom Line Indicator */}\\n                <span\\n                  aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"\\n                  className={`absolute bottom-1 left-3.5 right-3.5 h-[1.5px] transition-transform duration-200 origin-center ${\\n                    darkMode ? \'bg-zinc-100\' : \'bg-zinc-900\'\\n                  } ${\\n                    isActive || isHovered ? \'scale-x-100\' : \'scale-x-0\'\\n                  }`}\\n                />\\n              </a>\\n            );\\n          })}\\n        </nav>\\n\\n        {/* Zone 3: Theme Toggle & Contact Me Button */}\\n        <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-2.5 shrink-0\\\">\\n          <button\\n            type=\\\"button\\\"\\n            onClick={onToggleDarkMode}\\n            aria-label={\\n              darkMode\\n                ? \'Ubah ke Tema Monokrom Terang\'\\n                : \'Ubah ke Tema Monokrom Gelap\'\\n            }\\n            className={`w-10 h-10 rounded-xl border flex items-center justify-center transition-all duration-200 cursor-pointer ${\\n              darkMode\\n                ? \'border-white/15 bg-white/5 text-zinc-200 hover:bg-white/15\'\\n                : \'border-zinc-900/12 bg-zinc-900/[0.03] text-zinc-800 hover:bg-zinc-900/10\'\\n            }`}\\n          >\\n            {darkMode ? (\\n              <Sun className=\\\"w-4 h-4\\\" />\\n            ) : (\\n              <Moon className=\\\"w-4 h-4\\\" />\\n            )}\\n          </button>\\n\\n          <a\\n            href={`#${ctaItem.id}`}\\n            onClick={(e) => handleNavClick(e, ctaItem.id)}\\n            className={`hidden sm:inline-flex items-center justify-center px-5 py-2.5 rounded-xl text-xs sm:text-sm font-semibold tracking-wide whitespace-nowrap shrink-0 border transition-all duration-200 ${\\n              activeSection === ctaItem.id\\n                ? darkMode\\n                  ? \'bg-white text-zinc-950 border-white shadow-sm\'\\n                  : \'bg-zinc-950 text-white border-zinc-950 shadow-sm\'\\n                : darkMode\\n                  ? \'border-zinc-200 text-zinc-100 hover:bg-white hover:text-zinc-950\'\\n                  : \'border-zinc-900 text-zinc-900 hover:bg-zinc-950 hover:text-white\'\\n            }`}\\n          >\\n            {ctaItem.label}\\n          </a>\\n\\n          {/* Mobile Hamburger Trigger */}\\n          <button\\n            type=\\\"button\\\"\\n            onClick={() => setMobileMenuOpen((prev) => !prev)}\\n            aria-label={mobileMenuOpen ? \'Tutup Menu Navigasi\' : \'Buka Menu Navigasi\'}\\n            aria-expanded={mobileMenuOpen}\\n            className={`lg:hidden w-10 h-10 rounded-xl border flex items-center justify-center transition-colors cursor-pointer ${\\n              darkMode\\n                ? \'border-white/15 bg-white/5 text-zinc-100 hover:bg-white/10\'\\n                : \'border-zinc-900/15 bg-zinc-900/5 text-zinc-900 hover:bg-zinc-900/10\'\\n            }`}\\n          >\\n            {mobileMenuOpen ? <X className=\\\"w-4 h-4\\\" /> : <Menu className=\\\"w-4 h-4\\\" />}\\n          </button>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      {/* Responsive Mobile Glass Drawer */}\\n      {mobileMenuOpen && (\\n        <div\\n          className={`lg:hidden max-w-[1160px] mx-auto mt-2 pointer-events-auto rounded-2xl backdrop-blur-xl border p-4 transition-all ${\\n            darkMode\\n              ? \'bg-zinc-900/90 border-white/15 text-zinc-100 shadow-2xl\'\\n              : \'bg-white/90 border-zinc-900/10 text-zinc-900 shadow-xl\'\\n          }`}\\n        >\\n          <div className=\\\"flex flex-col gap-1\\\">\\n            {centerItems.map((item) => {\\n              const isActive = activeSection === item.id;\\n              return (\\n                <a\\n                  key={item.id}\\n                  href={`#${item.id}`}\\n                  onClick={(e) => handleNavClick(e, item.id)}\\n                  className={`px-4 py-2.5 rounded-xl text-xs font-semibold tracking-[0.14em] uppercase transition-colors ${\\n                    isActive\\n                      ? darkMode\\n                        ? \'bg-white/15 text-white\'\\n                        : \'bg-zinc-900/10 text-zinc-950\'\\n                      : darkMode\\n                        ? \'text-zinc-300 hover:bg-white/10\'\\n                        : \'text-zinc-600 hover:bg-zinc-900/5\'\\n                  }`}\\n                >\\n                  {item.label}\\n                </a>\\n              );\\n            })}\\n            <a\\n              href={`#${ctaItem.id}`}\\n              onClick={(e) => handleNavClick(e, ctaItem.id)}\\n              className={`mt-2 px-4 py-2.5 rounded-xl text-center text-xs font-semibold tracking-wider uppercase border transition-colors ${\\n                darkMode\\n                  ? \'bg-white text-zinc-950 border-white\'\\n                  : \'bg-zinc-950 text-white border-zinc-950\'\\n              }`}\\n            >\\n              {ctaItem.label}\\n            </a>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n      )}\\n    </header>\\n  );\\n};\\n\", \"Description\":\"Create persistent glassmorphic Navbar component matching user specification and image.png reference\", \"Overwrite\":true, \"TargetFile\":\"/src/components/Navbar.tsx\", \"toolAction\":\"Creating glassmorphic Navbar component\", \"toolSummary\":\"Create Navbar.tsx\"}"
      thinking_signature: "\022\204C\n\201C\001i\024}\023\2333b\332;\247\312\260\355\255\341\350\023\036\342\006\206\230,\\\264\255\a\346N/\214\"\377X?$\322%\301\264\333\033|j\276\213\203Q~\220|@\257iL+\3345\f\370/Y#\351\001!F\362f\201\\\332\306\004}\317N\372\205y\216E\353n\342\263\353\357g2f\277\004t\214\251\301pE\215\227\a\002\244\277\235\216\374?2\005\206\354\305Q\307\373\237\326a\365\257\343\020\225]Dq\221S\016\353\243qgn\234\311<8\026m-\313:.>\200\016\031\270\335R\v |\335%\263\225\270-\033\224h\220\245\346\341\267\2418&\005\233;\211\fY\236\342\264\362\256\246!\323\2658N[\021\266~@\000_U\360\322B\3755\347\333u\265\213\026\375\003\032\337\371\200\270\226\033\003\217\366`\351\247\303\203|-?C\255\203\302;9Khf8D3\306\020\304\2473KM\005s\037\000\337\255\326\225\352\306\336\255O\360\204\311<5\242\003J?\220k\264!\351r\304<\2576\376A}E*.\027K\372DH8\020\332*o\352\026o\212Z4\370C\370D_\224\241\325\224;\264\024\262\243z\211\201\324\223w\200\235]\217\335\266\t\223\367?B\203\305\276j\324E\230$\346;\273\315\"\261\352K(G\206\aM\253a\222\300zW\'\352%\343\231Er\033\266\261\267i\317I\bu&\241\261_2(|O\201\203X\3778\005\017\261Hn\177\245\237\026\352\311\203\260r\301-\314\240DZ\202S\244\tX\177\002\373\006\033rU<d\307\327\307\313\212\203v8\275\262\\\362\"\350T 3o6\205B`\314m\242\002\341\232\350\360\216\230\037\272\255Y\216\342x{\331\362pp\375\360\242\202\222s\202X?\v\207@\311\'w\304.\004\2702/\217\aY\2432K[N\201\020+]2\033\320\375T\206\005\017\270\375Wf\243h\a\260\022\026l8\343\220\300\\7_\236\346\241\244(,\236\224\2748\372\276\030\320\372\220\243YY\'g`\374l\243\224\034\'\303\017\0256\306V\277\022\2242\364Vm[\366\346\026\271{V)\331\362c1\337a\243\020\005\212\216\302\205\341\177c\212\234\206\200\334\300c|\323*\240\370\311\347\032\303o\203\324\245\331\340\274H1\244\\\231r\256Jy0\245\037d\226\371\335f\366{\221\256\313\312O\243\365\032l\334J\031\aD\241\266@_`\245\262\274K\242\250\347\215<\\y Y\2171\253x\255j\345\316\2644?\2323\355o\362\nr2\032nl\b\377\242@\330\001y\226n\f\\;P\341\022R\2