    content: "### Page\n- Page URL: http://localhost:3000/\n- Page Title: Mahesa \342\200\224 Monochrome Portfolio\n### Snapshot\n```yaml\n- generic [ref=e3]:\n  - banner:\n    - generic [ref=e4]:\n      - link \"Mahesa \342\200\224 Kembali ke Beranda\" [ref=e5] [cursor=pointer]:\n        - /url: \"#home\"\n        - generic [ref=e6]: M\n        - generic [ref=e7]: Mahesa\n      - navigation \"Navigasi Utama Portofolio\" [ref=e8]:\n        - link \"About\" [ref=e9] [cursor=pointer]:\n          - /url: \"#about\"\n        - link \"Experience\" [ref=e12] [cursor=pointer]:\n          - /url: \"#experience\"\n        - link \"Competencies\" [ref=e15] [cursor=pointer]:\n          - /url: \"#competencies\"\n        - link \"Certification\" [ref=e18] [cursor=pointer]:\n          - /url: \"#certification\"\n        - link \"Projects\" [ref=e21] [cursor=pointer]:\n          - /url: \"#projects\"\n      - generic [ref=e24]:\n        - button \"Ubah ke Tema Monokrom Gelap\" [ref=e25] [cursor=pointer]\n        - link \"Contact Me\" [ref=e28] [cursor=pointer]:\n          - /url: \"#contact\"\n  - main [ref=e29]:\n    - region \"Beranda Portofolio Mahesa\" [ref=e30]:\n      - generic:\n        - generic:\n          - generic\n          - generic [aria-hidden]\n      - img \"Potret Mahesa Rizky Putra\" [ref=e33]\n      - generic [aria-hidden]:\n        - generic:\n          - generic [aria-hidden]\n          - generic [aria-hidden]\n      - generic [ref=e35]:\n        - paragraph [ref=e36]: Poltekkes Kemenkes Semarang\n        - heading \"Mahesa Rizky Putra I.\" [level=1] [ref=e37]\n        - paragraph [ref=e38]: Health Informatics, Digital Systems & Applied Research Professional\n        - generic [ref=e39]:\n          - button \"B&W Studio\" [ref=e40] [cursor=pointer]\n          - button \"Jeda Teks\" [ref=e45] [cursor=pointer]\n      - button \"Scroll Down ke Bagian About\" [ref=e50] [cursor=pointer]:\n        - generic [ref=e52]: Scroll Down\n    - region \"Dedikasi pada Presi