  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Analyzing User Request**\n\nI\'m currently dissecting the user\'s prompt and target CSS selector. My focus is on understanding the nuances of \"liquid glass\" in the context of web design. I\'m cross-referencing this with the provided CSS selector to establish the exact element targeted for the effect. My goal is to determine the optimal approach for applying this style.\n\n\n**Defining Liquid Glass Style**\n\nI\'ve moved on to refining the specifics of the liquid glass effect. I\'m focusing on creating an ultra-translucent, refractive backdrop using `backdrop-blur` and `saturate` properties, adjusting the transparency for light and dark modes. I am also considering multi-layered specular rims, incorporating shadow effects for both light and dark mode versions of the glass effect. Finally, I\'m working on a subtle diagonal liquid sheen gradient.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_366007"
      name: "replace_file_content"
      arguments_json: "{\"AllowMultiple\":false, \"Description\":\"Transform the navigation bar container into a refractive Liquid Glass bar with specular highlights and liquid droplet hover capsules\", \"EndLine\":176, \"Instruction\":\"Update the main navbar container and hover pills in src/components/Navbar.tsx to use Liquid Glass styling\", \"ReplacementContent\":\"  return (\\n    <header className=\\\"fixed top-4 sm:top-6 inset-x-0 z-50 px-4 sm:px-8 pointer-events-none\\\">\\n      <div\\n        className={`relative overflow-hidden max-w-[1160px] mx-auto pointer-events-auto rounded-[22px] backdrop-blur-2xl backdrop-saturate-[190%] border transition-all duration-300 px-4 sm:px-6 py-3 flex items-center justify-between gap-4 sm:gap-8 ${\\n          darkMode\\n            ? \'bg-gradient-to-br from-white/[0.14] via-zinc-900/45 to-white/[0.08] border-white/25 text-zinc-100 shadow-[inset_0_1px_1px_rgba(255,255,255,0.35),inset_0_-1px_2px_rgba(255,255,255,0.08),0_16px_40px_rgba(0,0,0,0.55)]\'\\n            : \'bg-gradient-to-br from-white/55 via-white/25 to-white/45 border-white/75 text-zinc-900 shadow-[inset_0_1.5px_1.5px_rgba(255,255,255,0.95),inset_0_-1px_2px_rgba(255,255,255,0.45),0_12px_36px_-4px_rgba(0,0,0,0.10),0_2px_10px_rgba(0,0,0,0.04)]\'\\n        }`}\\n      >\\n        {/* Top Specular Liquid Sheen Reflection */}\\n        <span\\n          aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"\\n          className={`pointer-events-none absolute inset-x-6 top-0 h-[1px] bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent ${\\n            darkMode ? \'via-white/50\' : \'via-white\'\\n          } to-transparent`}\\n        />\\n        {/* Subtle Bottom Caustic Reflection */}\\n        <span\\n          aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"\\n          className={`pointer-events-none absolute inset-x-12 bottom-0 h-[1px] bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent ${\\n            darkMode ? \'via-white/20\' : \'via-white/80\'\\n          } to-transparent`}\\n        />\\n\\n        {/* Zone 1: Brand (Mahesa) */}\\n        <a\\n          href={`#${brandItem.id}`}\\n          onClick={(e) => handleNavClick(e, brandItem.id)}\\n          className=\\\"relative z-10 group flex items-center gap-3 whitespace-nowrap shrink-0 focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-4\\\"\\n          aria-label=\\\"Mahesa \342\200\224 Kembali ke Beranda\\\"\\n        >\\n          <span\\n            className={`w-9 h-9 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center font-serif italic font-bold text-base transition-transform duration-200 group-hover:scale-105 ${\\n              darkMode\\n                ? \'bg-zinc-100 text-zinc-950 shadow-sm\'\\n                : \'bg-zinc-950 text-white shadow-sm\'\\n            }`}\\n          >\\n            M\\n          </span>\\n          <span className=\\\"font-display font-bold text-sm sm:text-base tracking-[0.18em] uppercase transition-opacity duration-200 group-hover:opacity-80\\\">\\n            {brandItem.label}\\n          </span>\\n        </a>\\n\\n        {/* Zone 2: Center Navigation Links (About - Experience - Competencies - Certification - Projects) */}\\n        <nav\\n          aria-label=\\\"Navigasi Utama Portofolio\\\"\\n          className=\\\"relative z-10 hidden lg:flex items-center gap-1 xl:gap-2\\\"\\n          onMouseLeave={() => setHoveredId(null)}\\n        >\\n          {centerItems.map((item) => {\\n            const isActive = activeSection === item.id;\\n            const isHovered = hoveredId === item.id;\\n\\n            return (\\n              <a\\n                key={item.id}\\n                href={`#${item.id}`}\\n                onClick={(e) => handleNavClick(e, item.id)}\\n                onMouseEnter={() => setHoveredId(item.id)}\\n                className={`relative px-3.5 py-2 rounded-xl text-xs xl:text-[13px] font-medium tracking-[0.12em] uppercase whitespace-nowrap shrink-0 transition-all duration-200 ${\\n                  isActive\\n                    ? darkMode\\n                      ? \'text-white font-semibold\'\\n                      : \'text-zinc-950 font-semibold\'\\n                    : darkMode\\n                      ? \'text-zinc-300 hover:text-white\'\\n                      : \'text-zinc-700 hover:text-zinc-950\'\\n                }`}\\n              >\\n                {/* Liquid Glass Droplet Hover Pill Indicator */}\\n                <span\\n                  aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"\\n                  className={`absolute inset-0 rounded-xl transition-all duration-200 ${\\n                    isHovered\\n                      ? darkMode\\n                        ? \'bg-white/15 border border-white/25 shadow-[inset_0_1px_1px_rgba(255,255,255,0.35)] opacity-100 scale-100\'\\n                        : \'bg-white/60 border border-white/80 shadow-[inset_0_1px_1px_rgba(255,255,255,0.95),0_2px_8px_rgba(0,0,0,0.05)] opacity-100 scale-100\'\\n                      : isActive\\n                        ? darkMode\\n                          ? \'bg-white/10 border border-white/15 opacity-100 scale-100\'\\n                          : \'bg-white/40 border border-white/60 opacity-100 scale-100\'\\n                        : \'opacity-0 scale-95\'\\n                  }`}\\n                />\\n\\n                {/* Menu Text */}\\n                <span className=\\\"relative z-10 inline-block transition-transform duration-200\\\">\\n                  {item.label}\\n                </span>\\n\\n                {/* Smooth Bottom Line Indicator */}\\n                <span\\n                  aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"\\n                  className={`absolute bottom-1 left-3.5 right-3.5 h-[1.5px] transition-transform duration-200 origin-center ${\\n                    darkMode ? \'bg-zinc-100\' : \'bg-zinc-900\'\\n                  } ${\\n                    isActive || isHovered ? \'scale-x-100\' : \'scale-x-0\'\\n                  }`}\\n                />\\n              </a>\\n            );\\n          })}\\n        </nav>\\n\\n        {/* Zone 3: Theme Toggle & Contact Me Button */}\\n        <div className=\\\"relative z-10 flex items-center gap-2.5 shrink-0\\\">\\n          <button\\n            type=\\\"button\\\"\\n            onClick={onToggleDarkMode}\\n            aria-label={\\n              darkMode\\n                ? \'Ubah ke Tema Monokrom Terang\'\\n                : \'Ubah ke Tema Monokrom Gelap\'\\n            }\\n            className={`w-10 h-10 rounded-xl border flex items-center justify-center transition-all duration-200 cursor-pointer ${\\n              darkMode\\n                ? \'border-white/20 bg-white/10 text-zinc-100 shadow-[inset_0_1px_1px_rgba(255,255,255,0.25)] hover:bg-white/20\'\\n                : \'border-white/80 bg-white/45 text-zinc-800 shadow-[inset_0_1px_1px_rgba(255,255,255,0.9),0_2px_6px_rgba(0,0,0,0.04)] hover:bg-white/70\'\\n            }`}\\n          >\\n            {darkMode ? (\\n              <Sun className=\\\"w-4 h-4\\\" />\\n            ) : (\\n              <Moon className=\\\"w-4 h-4\\\" />\\n            )}\\n          </button>\\n\\n          <a\\n            href={`#${ctaItem.id}`}\\n            onClick={(e) => handleNavClick(e, ctaItem.id)}\\n            className={`hidden sm:inline-flex items-center justify-center px-5 py-2.5 rounded-xl text-xs sm:text-sm font-semibold tracking-wide whitespace-nowrap shrink-0 border transition-all duration-200 ${\\n              activeSection === ctaItem.id\\n                ? darkMode\\n                  ? \'bg-white text-zinc-950 border-white shadow-sm\'\\n                  : \'bg-zinc-950 text-white border-zinc-950 shadow-sm\'\\n                : darkMode\\n                  ? \'border-white/30 bg-white/10 text-zinc-100 shadow-[inset_0_1px_1px_rgba(255,255,255,0.25)] hover:bg-white hover:text-zinc-950\'\\n                  : \'border-zinc-900/80 bg-white/35 text-zinc-900 shadow-[inset_0_1px_1px_rgba(255,255,255,0.85)] hover:bg-zinc-950 hover:text-white\'\\n            }`}\\n          >\\n            {ctaItem.label}\\n          </a>\\n\\n          {/* Mobile Hamburger Trigger */}\\n          <button\\n            type=\\\"button\\\"\\n            onClick={() => setMobileMenuOpen((prev) => !prev)}\\n            aria-label={mobileMenuOpen ? \'Tutup Menu Navigasi\' : \'Buka Menu Navigasi\'}\\n            aria-expanded={mobileMenuOpen}\\n            className={`lg:hidden w-10 h-10 rounded-xl border flex items-center justify-center transition-colors cursor-pointer ${\\n              darkMode\\n                ? \'border-white/20 bg-white/10 text-zinc-100 hover:bg-white/20\'\\n                : \'border-white/80 bg-white/45 text-zinc-900 hover:bg-white/70\'\\n            }`}\\n          >\\n            {mobileMenuOpen ? <X className=\\\"w-4 h-4\\\" /> : <Menu className=\\\"w-4 h-4\\\" />}\\n          </button>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\", \"StartLine\":31, \"TargetContent\":\"  return (\\n    <header className=\\\"fixed top-4 sm:top-6 inset-x-0 z-50 px-4 sm:px-8 pointer-events-none\\\">\\n      <div\\n        className={`max-w-[1160px] mx-auto pointer-events-auto rounded-2xl backdrop-blur-xl border transition-all duration-300 px-4 sm:px-6 py-3 flex items-center justify-between gap-4 sm:gap-8 ${\\n          darkMode\\n            ? \'bg-zinc-900/75 border-white/15 text-zinc-100 shadow-[0_12px_40px_rgba(0,0,0,0.55)]\'\\n            : \'bg-white/75 border-zinc-900/10 text-zinc-900 shadow-[0_10px_35px_rgba(0,0,0,0.06)]\'\\n        }`}\\n      >\\n        {/* Zone 1: Brand (Mahesa) */}\\n        <a\\n          href={`#${brandItem.id}`}\\n          onClick={(e) => handleNavClick(e, brandItem.id)}\\n          className=\\\"group flex items-center gap-3 whitespace-nowrap shrink-0 focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-4\\\"\\n          aria-label=\\\"Mahesa \342\200\224 Kembali ke Beranda\\\"\\n        >\\n          <span\\n            className={`w-9 h-9 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center font-serif italic font-bold text-base transition-transform duration-200 group-hover:scale-105 ${\\n              darkMode\\n                ? \'bg-zinc-100 text-zinc-950 shadow-sm\'\\n                : \'bg-zinc-950 text-white shadow-sm\'\\n            }`}\\n          >\\n            M\\n          </span>\\n          <span className=\\\"font-display font-bold text-sm sm:text-base tracking-[0.18em] uppercase transition-opacity duration-200 group-hover:opacity-80\\\">\\n            {brandItem.label}\\n          </span>\\n        </a>\\n\\n        {/* Zone 2: Center Navigation Links (About - Experience - Competencies - Certification - Projects) */}\\n        <nav\\n          aria-label=\\\"Navigasi Utama Portofolio\\\"\\n          className=\\\"hidden lg:flex items-center gap-1 xl:gap-2\\\"\\n          onMouseLeave={() => setHoveredId(null)}\\n        >\\n          {centerItems.map((item) => {\\n            const isActive = activeSection === item.id;\\n            const isHovered = hoveredId === item.id;\\n\\n            return (\\n              <a\\n                key={item.id}\\n                href={`#${item.id}`}\\n                onClick={(e) => handleNavClick(e, item.id)}\\n                onMouseEnter={() => setHoveredId(item.id)}\\n                className={`relative px-3.5 py-2 rounded-xl text-xs xl:text-[13px] font-medium tracking-[0.12em] uppercase whitespace-nowrap shrink-0 transition-all duration-200 ${\\n                  isActive\\n                    ? darkMode\\n                      ? \'text-white font-semibold\'\\n                      : \'text-zinc-950 font-semibold\'\\n                    : darkMode\\n                      ? \'text-zinc-400 hover:text-zinc-100\'\\n                      : \'text-zinc-600 hover:text-zinc-950\'\\n                }`}\\n              >\\n                {/* Glass Hover Pill Indicator */}\\n                <span\\n                  aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"\\n                  className={`absolute inset-0 rounded-xl transition-all duration-200 ${\\n                    isHovered\\n                      ? darkMode\\n                        ? \'bg-white/10 opacity-100 scale-100\'\\n                        : \'bg-zinc-900/[0.06] opacity-100 scale-100\'\\n                      : isActive\\n                        ? darkMode\\n                          ? \'bg-white/[0.06] opacity-100 scale-100\'\\n                          : \'bg-zinc-900/[0.04] opacity-100 scale-100\'\\n                        : \'opacity-0 scale-95\'\\n                  }`}\\n                />\\n\\n                {/* Menu Text */}\\n                <span className=\\\"relative z-10 inline-block transition-transform duration-200\\\">\\n                  {item.label}\\n                </span>\\n\\n                {/* Smooth Bottom Line Indicator */}\\n                <span\\n                  aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"\\n                  className={`absolute bottom-1 left-3.5 right-3.5 h-[1.5px] transition-transform duration-200 origin-center ${\\n                    darkMode ? \'bg-zinc-100\' : \'bg-zinc-900\'\\n                  } ${\\n                    isActive || isHovered ? \'scale-x-100\' : \'scale-x-0\'\\n                  }`}\\n                />\\n              </a>\\n            );\\n          })}\\n        </nav>\\n\\n        {/* Zone 3: Theme Toggle & Contact Me Button */}\\n        <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-2.5 shrink-0\\\">\\n          <button\\n            type=\\\"button\\\"\\n            onClick={onToggleDarkMode}\\n            aria-label={\\n              darkMode\\n                ? \'Ubah ke Tema Monokrom Terang\'\\n                : \'Ubah ke Tema Monokrom Gelap\'\\n            }\\n            className={`w-10 h-10 rounded-xl border flex items-center justify-center transition-all duration-200 cursor-pointer ${\\n              darkMode\\n                ? \'border-white/15 bg-white/5 text-zinc-200 hover:bg-white/15\'\\n                : \'border-zinc-900/12 bg-zinc-900/[0.03] text-zinc-800 hover:bg-zinc-900/10\'\\n            }`}\\n          >\\n            {darkMode ? (\\n              <Sun className=\\\"w-4 h-4\\\" />\\n            ) : (\\n              <Moon className=\\\"w-4 h-4\\\" />\\n            )}\\n          </button>\\n\\n          <a\\n            href={`#${ctaItem.id}`}\\n            onClick={(e) => handleNavClick(e, ctaItem.id)}\\n            className={`hidden sm:inline-flex items-center justify-center px-5 py-2.5 rounded-xl text-xs sm:text-sm font-semibold tracking-wide whitespace-nowrap shrink-0 border transition-all duration-200 ${\\n              activeSection === ctaItem.id\\n                ? darkMode\\n                  ? \'bg-white text-zinc-950 border-white shadow-sm\'\\n                  : \'bg-zinc-950 text-white border-zinc-950 shadow-sm\'\\n                : darkMode\\n                  ? \'border-zinc-200 text-zinc-100 hover:bg-white hover:text-zinc-950\'\\n                  : \'border-zinc-900 text-zinc-900 hover:bg-zinc-950 hover:text-white\'\\n            }`}\\n          >\\n            {ctaItem.label}\\n          </a>\\n\\n          {/* Mobile Hamburger Trigger */}\\n          <button\\n            type=\\\"button\\\"\\n            onClick={() => setMobileMenuOpen((prev) => !prev)}\\n            aria-label={mobileMenuOpen ? \'Tutup Menu Navigasi\' : \'Buka Menu Navigasi\'}\\n            aria-expanded={mobileMenuOpen}\\n            className={`lg:hidden w-10 h-10 rounded-xl border flex items-center justify-center transition-colors cursor-pointer ${\\n              darkMode\\n                ? \'border-white/15 bg-white/5 text-zinc-100 hover:bg-white/10\'\\n                : \'border-zinc-900/15 bg-zinc-900/5 text-zinc-900 hover:bg-zinc-900/10\'\\n            }`}\\n          >\\n            {mobileMenuOpen ? <X className=\\\"w-4 h-4\\\" /> : <Menu className=\\\"w-4 h-4\\\" />}\\n          </button>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\", \"TargetFile\":\"/src/components/Navbar.tsx\", \"toolAction\":\"Updating Navbar to Liquid Glass design\", \"toolSummary\":\"Update Navbar to Liquid Glass\"}"
