    thinking: "**Considering 3D Implementation**\n\nI\'m now contemplating the integration of a 3D Lanyard ID Card, influenced by that GitHub repository. It seems like a suitable replacement for the existing card in the `#about` section. I\'m exploring the feasibility of using three.js for this interactive element.\n\n\n"
