    thinking: "**Building the Lanyard Card**\n\nI\'m now focused on constructing the `/src/components/Lanyard3DCard.tsx` file. I\'m prioritizing adherence to best practices from `threejs` and the game development reference, specifically concerning the visual design of the 3D Lanyard Card. I\'m beginning the implementation, making sure to thoroughly integrate the best practices!\n\n\n**Designing the Lanyard Strap**\n\nI\'m now diving into the details of the lanyard strap. I\'m focusing on the implementation of a 32-segment ribbon mesh that will be generated along a `THREE.CatmullRomCurve3` connecting the card components. The texture will be a repeating woven print with \"MAHESA \302\267 PORTOFOLIO \302\267\" text, using a `THREE.CanvasTexture` for the woven effect. I\'m considering the metallic clip and clamp hardware, focusing on materials.\n\n\n**Defining Card Materiality**\n\nI\'m now detailing the materials of the 3D card. I\'m focusing on the `ExtrudeGeometry` for the body, with a polycarbonate badge rim, and a top slot cutout. The front face will use `MeshPhysicalMaterial`, with a high clearcoat for a glossy look, roughness, and metalness, mapped with a crisp `CanvasTexture`. I\'m integrating the portrait and identity information onto the front face. I am now working on the back face material.\n\n\n**Implementing Card Interactions**\n\nI\'m now implementing the interactive features. I\'ve integrated raycasting for pointer interactions, changing the cursor to reflect grab and drag states. I\'m unprojecting the pointer onto the card\'s Z plane to allow real-time pulling, stretching, and curving of the lanyard. I\'m also including bottom control pills for device compatibility and automated testing.\n\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_299460"
      name: "write_to_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"CodeContent\":\"import React, { useEffect, useRef, useState } from \'react\';\\nimport * as THREE from \'three\';\\nimport { RoomEnvironment } from \'three/addons/environments/RoomEnvironment.js\';\\nimport { RotateCw, Sparkles } from \'lucide-react\';\\nimport { PROFILE_DATA } from \'../data/portfolioData\';\\nimport {\\n  createLanyardPhysicsState,\\n  stepLanyardPhysics,\\n} from \'../utils/lanyardPhysics\';\\n\\ninterface Lanyard3DCardProps {\\n  darkMode: boolean;\\n}\\n\\nfunction createLanyardStrapTexture(maxAnisotropy: number): THREE.CanvasTexture {\\n  const canvas = document.createElement(\'canvas\');\\n  canvas.width = 1024;\\n  canvas.height = 128;\\n  const ctx = canvas.getContext(\'2d\')!;\\n\\n  // Deep matte jet-black strap background\\n  ctx.fillStyle = \'#111113\';\\n  ctx.fillRect(0, 0, canvas.width, canvas.height);\\n\\n  // Subtle woven nylon texture lines\\n  ctx.strokeStyle = \'rgba(255,255,255,0.06)\';\\n  ctx.lineWidth = 2;\\n  for (let x = 0; x < canvas.width; x += 8) {\\n    ctx.beginPath();\\n    ctx.moveTo(x, 0);\\n    ctx.lineTo(x, canvas.height);\\n    ctx.stroke();\\n  }\\n\\n  // Edge stitching lines\\n  ctx.strokeStyle = \'rgba(255,255,255,0.28)\';\\n  ctx.lineWidth = 3;\\n  ctx.setLineDash([10, 6]);\\n  ctx.beginPath();\\n  ctx.moveTo(0, 12);\\n  ctx.lineTo(canvas.width, 12);\\n  ctx.moveTo(0, canvas.height - 12);\\n  ctx.lineTo(canvas.width, canvas.height - 12);\\n  ctx.stroke();\\n  ctx.setLineDash([]);\\n\\n  // Repeating \\\"MAHESA \302\267 PORTOFOLIO \302\267\\\" typography along the strap\\n  ctx.fillStyle = \'#F4F4F5\';\\n  ctx.font = \'800 44px \\\"Outfit\\\", sans-serif\';\\n  ctx.textAlign = \'center\';\\n  ctx.textBaseline = \'middle\';\\n  ctx.fillText(\\n    \'MAHESA   \302\267   PORTOFOLIO   \302\267   MAHESA   \302\267\',\\n    canvas.width / 2,\\n    canvas.height / 2 + 2\\n  );\\n\\n  const texture = new THREE.CanvasTexture(canvas);\\n  texture.colorSpace = THREE.SRGBColorSpace;\\n  texture.wrapS = THREE.RepeatWrapping;\\n  texture.wrapT = THREE.RepeatWrapping;\\n  texture.repeat.set(3, 1);\\n  texture.anisotropy = maxAnisotropy;\\n  texture.needsUpdate = true;\\n  return texture;\\n}\\n\\nfunction drawCardFrontCanvas(\\n  canvas: HTMLCanvasElement,\\n  portraitImg?: HTMLImageElement\\n) {\\n  const ctx = canvas.getContext(\'2d\')!;\\n  const w = canvas.width;\\n  const h = canvas.height;\\n\\n  // Base editorial monochrome card surface\\n  const grad = ctx.createLinearGradient(0, 0, w, h);\\n  grad.addColorStop(0, \'#FAFAFA\');\\n  grad.addColorStop(1, \'#E4E4E7\');\\n  ctx.fillStyle = grad;\\n  ctx.fillRect(0, 0, w, h);\\n\\n  // Subtle architectural grid pattern\\n  ctx.strokeStyle = \'rgba(0,0,0,0.04)\';\\n  ctx.lineWidth = 2;\\n  for (let x = 0; x < w; x += 48) {\\n    ctx.beginPath();\\n    ctx.moveTo(x, 0);\\n    ctx.lineTo(x, h);\\n    ctx.stroke();\\n  }\\n  for (let y = 0; y < h; y += 48) {\\n    ctx.beginPath();\\n    ctx.moveTo(0, y);\\n    ctx.lineTo(w, y);\\n    ctx.stroke();\\n  }\\n\\n  // Top dark header band\\n  ctx.fillStyle = \'#09090B\';\\n  ctx.fillRect(0, 0, w, 240);\\n\\n  // Top slot punch-hole visual indicator\\n  ctx.fillStyle = \'#27272A\';\\n  ctx.beginPath();\\n  ctx.roundRect(w / 2 - 90, 38, 180, 28, 14);\\n  ctx.fill();\\n\\n  // Brand monogram badge in top-left of card\\n  ctx.fillStyle = \'#FFFFFF\';\\n  ctx.beginPath();\\n  ctx.roundRect(64, 102, 76, 76, 18);\\n  ctx.fill();\\n\\n  ctx.fillStyle = \'#09090B\';\\n  ctx.font = \'italic 700 48px Georgia, serif\';\\n  ctx.textAlign = \'center\';\\n  ctx.textBaseline = \'middle\';\\n  ctx.fillText(\'M\', 102, 142);\\n\\n  // Header text\\n  ctx.fillStyle = \'#FFFFFF\';\\n  ctx.textAlign = \'left\';\\n  ctx.font = \'800 34px \\\"Outfit\\\", sans-serif\';\\n  ctx.fillText(\'MAHESA\', 164, 128);\\n\\n  ctx.fillStyle = \'#A1A1AA\';\\n  ctx.font = \'500 20px \\\"JetBrains Mono\\\", monospace\';\\n  ctx.fillText(\'POLTEKKES KEMENKES SEMARANG\', 164, 164);\\n\\n  // Portrait Frame\\n  const frameX = 64;\\n  const frameY = 285;\\n  const frameW = w - 128;\\n  const frameH = 590;\\n\\n  ctx.save();\\n  ctx.beginPath();\\n  ctx.roundRect(frameX, frameY, frameW, frameH, 28);\\n  ctx.clip();\\n\\n  // Studio neutral backdrop behind portrait inside frame\\n  const pGrad = ctx.createRadialGradient(\\n    w / 2,\\n    frameY + frameH * 0.45,\\n    40,\\n    w / 2,\\n    frameY + frameH * 0.5,\\n    frameW * 0.7\\n  );\\n  pGrad.addColorStop(0, \'#F4F4F5\');\\n  pGrad.addColorStop(1, \'#D4D4D8\');\\n  ctx.fillStyle = pGrad;\\n  ctx.fillRect(frameX, frameY, frameW, frameH);\\n\\n  // Subtle \\\"PORTOFOLIO\\\" outline text behind portrait inside the card\\n  ctx.strokeStyle = \'rgba(24,24,27,0.18)\';\\n  ctx.lineWidth = 3;\\n  ctx.font = \'800 130px \\\"Outfit\\\", sans-serif\';\\n  ctx.textAlign = \'center\';\\n  ctx.strokeText(\'PORTOFOLIO\', w / 2, frameY + frameH * 0.54);\\n\\n  if (portraitImg && portraitImg.complete && portraitImg.naturalWidth > 0) {\\n    // Draw portrait centered & covering bottom of frame\\n    const imgAspect = portraitImg.naturalWidth / portraitImg.naturalHeight;\\n    const drawH = frameH * 0.96;\\n    const drawW = drawH * imgAspect;\\n    const drawX = w / 2 - drawW / 2;\\n    const drawY = frameY + frameH - drawH;\\n    ctx.drawImage(portraitImg, drawX, drawY, drawW, drawH);\\n  }\\n  ctx.restore();\\n\\n  // Frame border\\n  ctx.strokeStyle = \'rgba(9,9,11,0.12)\';\\n  ctx.lineWidth = 3;\\n  ctx.beginPath();\\n  ctx.roundRect(frameX, frameY, frameW, frameH, 28);\\n  ctx.stroke();\\n\\n  // Identity Details Below Photo\\n  ctx.fillStyle = \'#09090B\';\\n  ctx.textAlign = \'left\';\\n  ctx.font = \'800 46px \\\"Outfit\\\", sans-serif\';\\n  ctx.fillText(\'MAHESA RIZKY PUTRA I.\', 64, 950);\\n\\n  ctx.fillStyle = \'#52525B\';\\n  ctx.font = \'600 24px \\\"Plus Jakarta Sans\\\", sans-serif\';\\n  ctx.fillText(\'Health Informatics & Digital Systems\', 64, 998);\\n\\n  // Divider line\\n  ctx.strokeStyle = \'rgba(9,9,11,0.14)\';\\n  ctx.lineWidth = 2;\\n  ctx.beginPath();\\n  ctx.moveTo(64, 1040);\\n  ctx.lineTo(w - 64, 1040);\\n  ctx.stroke();\\n\\n  // Metadata rows\\n  ctx.font = \'500 22px \\\"JetBrains Mono\\\", monospace\';\\n  ctx.fillStyle = \'#71717A\';\\n  ctx.fillText(\'NIM\', 64, 1090);\\n  ctx.fillStyle = \'#09090B\';\\n  ctx.textAlign = \'right\';\\n  ctx.fillText(\'P1337437123106\', w - 64, 1090);\\n\\n  ctx.textAlign = \'left\';\\n  ctx.fillStyle = \'#71717A\';\\n  ctx.fillText(\'DOMISILI\', 64, 1140);\\n  ctx.fillStyle = \'#09090B\';\\n  ctx.textAlign = \'right\';\\n  ctx.fillText(\'SEMARANG, ID\', w - 64, 1140);\\n\\n  ctx.textAlign = \'left\';\\n  ctx.fillStyle = \'#71717A\';\\n  ctx.fillText(\'STATUS\', 64, 1190);\\n  ctx.fillStyle = \'#09090B\';\\n  ctx.textAlign = \'right\';\\n  ctx.fillText(\'VERIFIED PORTFOLIO\', w - 64, 1190);\\n\\n  // Bottom Barcode Strip\\n  ctx.fillStyle = \'#09090B\';\\n  const barY = 1255;\\n  const barH = 64;\\n  let curX = 64;\\n  const seed = [6, 3, 10, 4, 8, 3, 12, 5, 4, 9, 6, 3, 8, 12, 4, 6, 3, 10, 5, 8, 4, 11, 3, 6, 8, 4, 10, 5, 3, 7, 9, 4];\\n  for (let i = 0; i < seed.length && curX < w - 80; i++) {\\n    const bw = seed[i];\\n    if (i % 2 === 0) {\\n      ctx.fillRect(curX, barY, bw, barH);\\n    }\\n    curX += bw + 5;\\n  }\\n}\\n\\nfunction createCardBackTexture(maxAnisotropy: number): THREE.CanvasTexture {\\n  const canvas = document.createElement(\'canvas\');\\n  canvas.width = 1024;\\n  canvas.height = 1400;\\n  const ctx = canvas.getContext(\'2d\')!;\\n  const w = canvas.width;\\n  const h = canvas.height;\\n\\n  ctx.fillStyle = \'#09090B\';\\n  ctx.fillRect(0, 0, w, h);\\n\\n  // Magnetic stripe\\n  ctx.fillStyle = \'#18181B\';\\n  ctx.fillRect(0, 140, w, 130);\\n\\n  // Center monogram emblem\\n  ctx.strokeStyle = \'rgba(255,255,255,0.18)\';\\n  ctx.lineWidth = 4;\\n  ctx.beginPath();\\n  ctx.roundRect(w / 2 - 140, 420, 280, 280, 40);\\n  ctx.stroke();\\n\\n  ctx.fillStyle = \'#FFFFFF\';\\n  ctx.font = \'italic 700 130px Georgia, serif\';\\n  ctx.textAlign = \'center\';\\n  ctx.textBaseline = \'middle\';\\n  ctx.fillText(\'M\', w / 2, 560);\\n\\n  ctx.font = \'700 36px \\\"Outfit\\\", sans-serif\';\\n  ctx.fillText(\'MAHESA RIZKY PUTRA I.\', w / 2, 790);\\n\\n  ctx.fillStyle = \'#A1A1AA\';\\n  ctx.font = \'500 24px \\\"JetBrains Mono\\\", monospace\';\\n  ctx.fillText(\'POLTEKKES KEMENKES SEMARANG\', w / 2, 845);\\n  ctx.fillText(\'DIGITAL IDENTITY CARD \302\267 2026\', w / 2, 890);\\n\\n  // Footer note\\n  ctx.fillStyle = \'#71717A\';\\n  ctx.font = \'400 22px \\\"Plus Jakarta Sans\\\", sans-serif\';\\n  ctx.fillText(\\n    \'Kartu identitas interaktif 3D \342\200\224 Tarik untuk mengayunkan\',\\n    w / 2,\\n    1240\\n  );\\n\\n  const tex = new THREE.CanvasTexture(canvas);\\n  tex.colorSpace = THREE.SRGBColorSpace;\\n  tex.anisotropy = maxAnisotropy;\\n  tex.needsUpdate = true;\\n  return tex;\\n}\\n\\nexport const Lanyard3DCard: React.FC<Lanyard3DCardProps> = ({ darkMode }) => {\\n  const canvasMountRef = useRef<HTMLDivElement | null>(null);\\n  const physicsRef = useRef(createLanyardPhysicsState());\\n  const [isHovered, setIsHovered] = useState(false);\\n  const [isDragging, setIsDragging] = useState(false);\\n\\n  const triggerSwingImpulse = () => {\\n    const st = physicsRef.current;\\n    st.nodes[4].pos.x += 1.15;\\n    st.nodes[3].pos.x += 0.65;\\n    st.angVel.y += 5.5;\\n  };\\n\\n  const triggerSpinImpulse = () => {\\n    const st = physicsRef.current;\\n    st.angVel.y += 14.0;\\n  };\\n\\n  useEffect(() => {\\n    const container = canvasMountRef.current;\\n    if (!container) return;\\n\\n    // 1. Detect software WebGL per threejs skill rules\\n    const isSoftwareGl = (() => {\\n      const gl = document.createElement(\'canvas\').getContext(\'webgl2\');\\n      if (!gl) return true;\\n      const ext = gl.getExtension(\'WEBGL_debug_renderer_info\');\\n      const param = ext ? ext.UNMASKED_RENDERER_WEBGL : gl.RENDERER;\\n      const gpu = String(gl.getParameter(param));\\n      gl.getExtension(\'WEBGL_lose_context\')?.loseContext();\\n      return /SwiftShader|llvmpipe|softpipe|Software|Basic Render/i.test(gpu);\\n    })();\\n\\n    const width = container.clientWidth || 440;\\n    const height = container.clientHeight || 540;\\n\\n    const scene = new THREE.Scene();\\n    const camera = new THREE.PerspectiveCamera(26, width / height, 0.1, 100);\\n    camera.position.set(0, 0, 11.5);\\n\\n    const renderer = new THREE.WebGLRenderer({\\n      antialias: !isSoftwareGl,\\n      alpha: true,\\n      powerPreference: \'high-performance\',\\n    });\\n    renderer.outputColorSpace = THREE.SRGBColorSpace;\\n    renderer.toneMapping = THREE.ACESFilmicToneMapping;\\n    renderer.toneMappingExposure = 1.08;\\n    renderer.setPixelRatio(\\n      isSoftwareGl ? 1 : Math.min(window.devicePixelRatio, 2)\\n    );\\n    renderer.setSize(width, height);\\n\\n    container.innerHTML = \'\';\\n    container.appendChild(renderer.domElement);\\n\\n    // 2. Studio Environment Map (RoomEnvironment) for realistic clearcoat & chrome reflections\\n    const pmremGenerator = new THREE.PMREMGenerator(renderer);\\n    const envTexture = pmremGenerator.fromScene(\\n      new RoomEnvironment(),\\n      0.04\\n    ).texture;\\n    scene.environment = envTexture;\\n    pmremGenerator.dispose();\\n\\n    // 3. Balanced Warm/Cool 3-Point Studio Lighting Rig\\n    const hemiLight = new THREE.HemisphereLight(0xffffff, 0x3f3f46, 1.2);\\n    scene.add(hemiLight);\\n\\n    const keyLight = new THREE.DirectionalLight(0xfffbeb, 2.2);\\n    keyLight.position.set(4, 6, 8);\\n    scene.add(keyLight);\\n\\n    const rimLight = new THREE.DirectionalLight(0xe4e4e7, 1.6);\\n    rimLight.position.set(-5, 3, -6);\\n    scene.add(rimLight);\\n\\n    const maxAnisotropy = renderer.capabilities.getMaxAnisotropy();\\n\\n    // 4. Procedural Textures (Front Card with Portrait, Back Card, Lanyard Strap)\\n    const frontCanvas = document.createElement(\'canvas\');\\n    frontCanvas.width = 1024;\\n    frontCanvas.height = 1400;\\n    drawCardFrontCanvas(frontCanvas);\\n\\n    const frontTexture = new THREE.CanvasTexture(frontCanvas);\\n    frontTexture.colorSpace = THREE.SRGBColorSpace;\\n    frontTexture.anisotropy = maxAnisotropy;\\n\\n    // Load Mahesa\'s portrait image onto the 3D card face\\n    const portraitImage = new Image();\\n    portraitImage.crossOrigin = \'anonymous\';\\n    portraitImage.onload = () => {\\n      drawCardFrontCanvas(frontCanvas, portraitImage);\\n      frontTexture.needsUpdate = true;\\n    };\\n    portraitImage.src = PROFILE_DATA.portraitSrc;\\n\\n    const backTexture = createCardBackTexture(maxAnisotropy);\\n    const strapTexture = createLanyardStrapTexture(maxAnisotropy);\\n\\n    // 5. Build Composite 3D Card & Metallic Clip Assembly (THREE.Group)\\n    const cardGroup = new THREE.Group();\\n    scene.add(cardGroup);\\n\\n    const cardW = 2.05;\\n    const cardH = 2.85;\\n    const cardDepth = 0.06;\\n\\n    // 5a. Outer Polycarbonate Badge Frame\\n    const frameGeo = new THREE.BoxGeometry(\\n      cardW + 0.08,\\n      cardH + 0.08,\\n      cardDepth\\n    );\\n    const frameMat = new THREE.MeshPhysicalMaterial({\\n      color: 0x18181b,\\n      roughness: 0.25,\\n      metalness: 0.4,\\n      clearcoat: 0.8,\\n    });\\n    const frameMesh = new THREE.Mesh(frameGeo, frameMat);\\n    cardGroup.add(frameMesh);\\n\\n    // 5b. Front ID Card Face (Clearcoat Glossy PBR)\\n    const faceGeo = new THREE.PlaneGeometry(cardW, cardH);\\n    const frontMat = new THREE.MeshPhysicalMaterial({\\n      map: frontTexture,\\n      color: 0xffffff,\\n      roughness: 0.22,\\n      metalness: 0.1,\\n      clearcoat: 1.0,\\n      clearcoatRoughness: 0.12,\\n    });\\n    const frontMesh = new THREE.Mesh(faceGeo, frontMat);\\n    frontMesh.position.z = cardDepth / 2 + 0.002;\\n    cardGroup.add(frontMesh);\\n\\n    // 5c. Back ID Card Face\\n    const backMat = new THREE.MeshPhysicalMaterial({\\n      map: backTexture,\\n      color: 0xffffff,\\n      roughness: 0.28,\\n      metalness: 0.2,\\n      clearcoat: 0.9,\\n      clearcoatRoughness: 0.15,\\n    });\\n    const backMesh = new THREE.Mesh(faceGeo, backMat);\\n    backMesh.rotation.y = Math.PI;\\n    backMesh.position.z = -(cardDepth / 2 + 0.002);\\n    cardGroup.add(backMesh);\\n\\n    // 5d. Metallic Clamp, Swivel Ring & Badge Clip Hardware at Top of Card\\n    const metalMat = new THREE.MeshStandardMaterial({\\n      color: 0xd4d4d8,\\n      metalness: 0.92,\\n      roughness: 0.2,\\n    });\\n    const darkMetalMat = new THREE.MeshStandardMaterial({\\n      color: 0x27272a,\\n      metalness: 0.85,\\n      roughness: 0.3,\\n    });\\n\\n    // Badge top tab\\n    const tabGeo = new THREE.BoxGeometry(0.65, 0.2, 0.07);\\n    const tabMesh = new THREE.Mesh(tabGeo, frameMat);\\n    tabMesh.position.set(0, cardH / 2 + 0.1, 0);\\n    cardGroup.add(tabMesh);\\n\\n    // Metallic clip jaws gripping the card top\\n    const clipJawGeo = new THREE.BoxGeometry(0.32, 0.28, 0.1);\\n    const clipJawMesh = new THREE.Mesh(clipJawGeo, metalMat);\\n    clipJawMesh.position.set(0, cardH / 2 + 0.18, 0);\\n    cardGroup.add(clipJawMesh);\\n\\n    // Swivel ring connecting clip to strap clamp\\n    const ringGeo = new THREE.TorusGeometry(0.14, 0.032, 12, 24);\\n    const ringMesh = new THREE.Mesh(ringGeo, metalMat);\\n    ringMesh.position.set(0, cardH / 2 + 0.36, 0);\\n    cardGroup.add(ringMesh);\\n\\n    // Upper strap crimper clamp\\n    const clampGeo = new THREE.BoxGeometry(0.46, 0.18, 0.09);\\n    const clampMesh = new THREE.Mesh(clampGeo, darkMetalMat);\\n    clampMesh.position.set(0, cardH / 2 + 0.5, 0);\\n    cardGroup.add(clampMesh);\\n\\n    // 6. Dynamic 3D Lanyard Ribbon Geometry (CatmullRomCurve3)\\n    const ribbonSegments = 36;\\n    const ribbonWidth = 0.42;\\n    const ribbonGeo = new THREE.BufferGeometry();\\n    const vertexCount = (ribbonSegments + 1) * 2;\\n    const positions = new Float32Array(vertexCount * 3);\\n    const uvs = new Float32Array(vertexCount * 2);\\n    const indices: number[] = [];\\n\\n    for (let i = 0; i <= ribbonSegments; i++) {\\n      const v = i / ribbonSegments;\\n      uvs[i * 4 + 0] = v;\\n      uvs[i * 4 + 1] = 0;\\n      uvs[i * 4 + 2] = v;\\n      uvs[i * 4 + 3] = 1;\\n      if (i < ribbonSegments) {\\n        const a = i * 2;\\n        const b = i * 2 + 1;\\n        const c = (i + 1) * 2;\\n        const d = (i + 1) * 2 + 1;\\n        indices.push(a, b, c, b, d, c);\\n      }\\n    }\\n    ribbonGeo.setAttribute(\'position\', new THREE.BufferAttribute(positions, 3));\\n    ribbonGeo.setAttribute(\'uv\', new THREE.BufferAttribute(uvs, 2));\\n    ribbonGeo.setIndex(indices);\\n\\n    const ribbonMat = new THREE.MeshStandardMaterial({\\n      map: strapTexture,\\n      color: 0xffffff,\\n      roughness: 0.65,\\n      metalness: 0.1,\\n      side: THREE.DoubleSide,\\n    });\\n    const ribbonMesh = new THREE.Mesh(ribbonGeo, ribbonMat);\\n    ribbonMesh.frustumCulled = false;\\n    scene.add(ribbonMesh);\\n\\n    // Pre-allocated scratch vectors for zero-GC animation loop\\n    const curvePoints = [\\n      new THREE.Vector3(),\\n      new THREE.Vector3(),\\n      new THREE.Vector3(),\\n      new THREE.Vector3(),\\n    ];\\n    const curve = new THREE.CatmullRomCurve3(curvePoints);\\n    curve.curveType = \'chordal\';\\n\\n    const raycaster = new THREE.Raycaster();\\n    const pointerNdc = new THREE.Vector2();\\n    const unprojectedVec = new THREE.Vector3();\\n    const rayDir = new THREE.Vector3();\\n    const dragOffset = new THREE.Vector3();\\n    const interactables = [frameMesh, frontMesh, backMesh];\\n\\n    const updateRibbonGeometry = () => {\\n      const st = physicsRef.current;\\n      // Top of clamp in world space\\n      const clampTopOffset = new THREE.Vector3(0, cardH / 2 + 0.54, 0);\\n      clampTopOffset.applyEuler(cardGroup.rotation);\\n      clampTopOffset.add(cardGroup.position);\\n\\n      curvePoints[0].copy(clampTopOffset);\\n      curvePoints[1].set(\\n        st.nodes[2].lerped.x,\\n        st.nodes[2].lerped.y,\\n        st.nodes[2].lerped.z\\n      );\\n      curvePoints[2].set(\\n        st.nodes[1].lerped.x,\\n        st.nodes[1].lerped.y,\\n        st.nodes[1].lerped.z\\n      );\\n      curvePoints[3].set(\\n        st.nodes[0].pos.x,\\n        st.nodes[0].pos.y,\\n        st.nodes[0].pos.z\\n      );\\n\\n      const sampled = curve.getPoints(ribbonSegments);\\n      const posAttr = ribbonGeo.getAttribute(\\n        \'position\'\\n      ) as THREE.BufferAttribute;\\n\\n      for (let i = 0; i <= ribbonSegments; i++) {\\n        const pt = sampled[i];\\n        // Slight twist along the card\'s Y rotation near the bottom of the strap\\n        const t = 1 - i / ribbonSegments;\\n        const twistAngle = cardGroup.rotation.y * t * 0.5;\\n        const halfW = ribbonWidth * 0.5;\\n        const dx = Math.cos(twistAngle) * halfW;\\n        const dz = Math.sin(twistAngle) * halfW;\\n\\n        posAttr.setXYZ(i * 2, pt.x - dx, pt.y, pt.z - dz);\\n        posAttr.setXYZ(i * 2 + 1, pt.x + dx, pt.y, pt.z + dz);\\n      }\\n      posAttr.needsUpdate = true;\\n      ribbonGeo.computeVertexNormals();\\n    };\\n\\n    // 7. Pointer interaction handlers (Grab & Drag in 3D space)\\n    const getNdcFromEvent = (clientX: number, clientY: number) => {\\n      const rect = renderer.domElement.getBoundingClientRect();\\n      pointerNdc.x = ((clientX - rect.left) / rect.width) * 2 - 1;\\n      pointerNdc.y = -((clientY - rect.top) / rect.height) * 2 + 1;\\n    };\\n\\n    const projectPointerToCardPlane = (out: THREE.Vector3) => {\\n      unprojectedVec.set(pointerNdc.x, pointerNdc.y, 0.5).unproject(camera);\\n      rayDir.copy(unprojectedVec).sub(camera.position).normalize();\\n      const dist = camera.position.length();\\n      out.copy(camera.position).add(rayDir.multiplyScalar(dist));\\n    };\\n\\n    const onPointerDown = (e: PointerEvent) => {\\n      getNdcFromEvent(e.clientX, e.clientY);\\n      raycaster.setFromCamera(pointerNdc, camera);\\n      const hits = raycaster.intersectObjects(interactables, false);\\n      if (hits.length > 0) {\\n        const st = physicsRef.current;\\n        st.isDragged = true;\\n        setIsDragging(true);\\n        const worldPt = new THREE.Vector3();\\n        projectPointerToCardPlane(worldPt);\\n        dragOffset.set(\\n          worldPt.x - st.nodes[4].pos.x,\\n          worldPt.y - st.nodes[4].pos.y,\\n          worldPt.z - st.nodes[4].pos.z\\n        );\\n        st.dragTarget = { ...st.nodes[4].pos };\\n        renderer.domElement.setPointerCapture(e.pointerId);\\n      }\\n    };\\n\\n    const onPointerMove = (e: PointerEvent) => {\\n      getNdcFromEvent(e.clientX, e.clientY);\\n      const st = physicsRef.current;\\n      if (st.isDragged) {\\n        const worldPt = new THREE.Vector3();\\n        projectPointerToCardPlane(worldPt);\\n        st.dragTarget = {\\n          x: Math.max(-2.4, Math.min(2.4, worldPt.x - dragOffset.x)),\\n          y: Math.max(-2.2, Math.min(1.8, worldPt.y - dragOffset.y)),\\n          z: Math.max(-1.2, Math.min(1.2, worldPt.z - dragOffset.z)),\\n        };\\n        return;\\n      }\\n\\n      raycaster.setFromCamera(pointerNdc, camera);\\n      const hits = raycaster.intersectObjects(interactables, false);\\n      setIsHovered(hits.length > 0);\\n    };\\n\\n    const onPointerUp = (e: PointerEvent) => {\\n      const st = physicsRef.current;\\n      if (st.isDragged) {\\n        st.isDragged = false;\\n        setIsDragging(false);\\n        try {\\n          renderer.domElement.releasePointerCapture(e.pointerId);\\n        } catch {\\n          // ignore if not captured\\n        }\\n      }\\n    };\\n\\n    const domEl = renderer.domElement;\\n    domEl.addEventListener(\'pointerdown\', onPointerDown);\\n    domEl.addEventListener(\'pointermove\', onPointerMove);\\n    window.addEventListener(\'pointerup\', onPointerUp);\\n\\n    const onResize = () => {\\n      if (!container) return;\\n      const newW = container.clientWidth || 440;\\n      const newH = container.clientHeight || 540;\\n      camera.aspect = newW / newH;\\n      camera.updateProjectionMatrix();\\n      renderer.setSize(newW, newH);\\n    };\\n    window.addEventListener(\'resize\', onResize);\\n\\n    if (!isSoftwareGl) {\\n      renderer.compile(scene, camera);\\n    }\\n\\n    // 8. Animation Loop with Software-WebGL Pacing (afterDraw)\\n    let frameId = 0;\\n    let disposed = false;\\n    let lastTime = performance.now();\\n\\n    function afterDraw(cb: () => void) {\\n      const gl = renderer.getContext() as WebGL2RenderingContext;\\n      const sync = gl.fenceSync ? gl.fenceSync(gl.SYNC_GPU_COMMANDS_COMPLETE, 0) : null;\\n      gl.flush();\\n      const poll = () => {\\n        if (disposed) return;\\n        const state = sync && gl.getSyncParameter(sync, gl.SYNC_STATUS);\\n        if (state === gl.UNSIGNALED) {\\n          frameId = window.setTimeout(poll, 5);\\n        } else {\\n          if (sync) gl.deleteSync(sync);\\n          frameId = window.setTimeout(cb, 80);\\n        }\\n      };\\n      frameId = window.setTimeout(poll, 5);\\n    }\\n\\n    function tick() {\\n      if (disposed) return;\\n      const now = performance.now();\\n      const dt = Math.min((now - lastTime) / 1000, 0.033);\\n      lastTime = now;\\n\\n      const st = physicsRef.current;\\n      stepLanyardPhysics(st, dt);\\n\\n      // Position card group so its top clamp connects to node[4]\\n      cardGroup.position.set(\\n        st.nodes[4].pos.x,\\n        st.nodes[4].pos.y - (cardH / 2 + 0.2),\\n        st.nodes[4].pos.z\\n      );\\n      cardGroup.rotation.set(st.rot.x, st.rot.y, st.rot.z);\\n\\n      updateRibbonGeometry();\\n      renderer.render(scene, camera);\\n\\n      if (isSoftwareGl) {\\n        afterDraw(tick);\\n      } else {\\n        frameId = requestAnimationFrame(tick);\\n      }\\n    }\\n\\n    tick();\\n\\n    return () => {\\n      disposed = true;\\n      cancelAnimationFrame(frameId);\\n      clearTimeout(frameId);\\n      domEl.removeEventListener(\'pointerdown\', onPointerDown);\\n      domEl.removeEventListener(\'pointermove\', onPointerMove);\\n      window.removeEventListener(\'pointerup\', onPointerUp);\\n      window.removeEventListener(\'resize\', onResize);\\n\\n      frontTexture.dispose();\\n      backTexture.dispose();\\n      strapTexture.dispose();\\n      envTexture.dispose();\\n      frameGeo.dispose();\\n      faceGeo.dispose();\\n      tabGeo.dispose();\\n      clipJawGeo.dispose();\\n      ringGeo.dispose();\\n      clampGeo.dispose();\\n      ribbonGeo.dispose();\\n      frameMat.dispose();\\n      frontMat.dispose();\\n      backMat.dispose();\\n      metalMat.dispose();\\n      darkMetalMat.dispose();\\n      ribbonMat.dispose();\\n      renderer.dispose();\\n    };\\n  }, []);\\n\\n  return (\\n    <div\\n      className={`h-full min-h-[500px] sm:min-h-[540px] rounded-2xl border relative overflow-hidden flex flex-col justify-between transition-colors ${\\n        darkMode\\n          ? \'bg-zinc-950/90 border-white/12 text-zinc-100\'\\n          : \'bg-[#111113] border-zinc-900/20 text-zinc-100\'\\n      }`}\\n    >\\n      {/* Subtle Studio Radial Glow Behind 3D Lanyard */}\\n      <div\\n        aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"\\n        className=\\\"pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 bg-[radial-gradient(circle_at_50%_42%,rgba(255,255,255,0.14)_0%,rgba(0,0,0,0.8)_75%)]\\\"\\n      />\\n\\n      {/* Top Minimal Badge Header */}\\n      <div className=\\\"relative z-10 px-5 pt-4 flex items-center justify-between text-[11px] font-mono text-zinc-400 pointer-events-none\\\">\\n        <span>3D INTERACTIVE LANYARD</span>\\n        <span>DRAG & RELEASE</span>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      {/* Dedicated WebGL Mount Container */}\\n      <div\\n        ref={canvasMountRef}\\n        data-testid=\\\"lanyard-3d-canvas\\\"\\n        className={`relative z-10 w-full flex-1 min-h-[420px] select-none ${\\n          isDragging ? \'cursor-grabbing\' : isHovered ? \'cursor-grab\' : \'cursor-default\'\\n        }`}\\n      />\\n\\n      {/* Bottom Interactive Control Bar (No backdrop-filter over WebGL per threejs skill) */}\\n      <div className=\\\"relative z-10 px-4 pb-4 pt-2 flex items-center justify-between gap-2 border-t border-white/10 bg-[#141417]\\\">\\n        <span className=\\\"text-[11px] font-mono text-zinc-400 truncate\\\">\\n          Tarik kartu untuk mengayunkan\\n        </span>\\n\\n        <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-2 shrink-0\\\">\\n          <button\\n            type=\\\"button\\\"\\n            onClick={triggerSwingImpulse}\\n            className=\\\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg text-xs font-medium bg-white/10 text-zinc-100 hover:bg-white/20 border border-white/15 transition-colors cursor-pointer whitespace-nowrap shrink-0\\\"\\n          >\\n            <Sparkles className=\\\"w-3.5 h-3.5\\\" />\\n            <span>Ayunkan</span>\\n          </button>\\n\\n          <button\\n            type=\\\"button\\\"\\n            onClick={triggerSpinImpulse}\\n            className=\\\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg text-xs font-medium bg-white/10 text-zinc-100 hover:bg-white/20 border border-white/15 transition-colors cursor-pointer whitespace-nowrap shrink-0\\\"\\n          >\\n            <RotateCw className=\\\"w-3.5 h-3.5\\\" />\\n            <span>Putar 360\302\260</span>\\n          </button>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n  );\\n};\\n\", \"Description\":\"Create interactive Three.js Lanyard3DCard component inspired by fattahmaulana/3D_CARD\", \"Overwrite\":true, \"TargetFile\":\"/src/components/Lanyard3DCard.tsx\", \"toolAction\":\"Creating Lanyard3DCard 3D component\", \"toolSummary\":\"Create Lanyard3DCard.tsx\"}"
      thinking_signature: "\022\313\"\n\310\"\001i\024}\023V\321\177\306\202\373v&d\233\312Q\024\a]E\022\370\314\034\234\214\244\345#6\274\227=-\364\3216C\033gc\272\323\231ve\360\204\313\023\260Awa\301q\327\365)6V1\356\263\"\244\344\332\022\206\325\277\324\a?<\177&\000\220\243fm\021:\370D\267\267\304KI\233\a\235k\310\037\306\313y<\b\304\314\355\264dmc\337\026\177;\225\373\003\002@\331\320\356\310\335\36169\221\247\235Y;8C\322\335\324\204\252\373\220=z\264]\244/\233\v\255\313\367\030\243\t\246\232`^-\237^g\205\223+l\230<\342\026(\216\216\226\rK\036\312\242\217S|\0317\373\210\335\340\256Ue\002n\005k\217|r#\256\200\003*b\241\311P\325W\213\260\335z\244g\001[=\230U\374\317K\2220\313M\352\261W\247\212\206P\236\330\236\353e\343[\324\001\257\033\020\247\303\2063\f\337\237?_K\357Y\371\323q\305(Q\336\025\260z\311\227$\257\265\264\375\233\031\235\025Nt#\367}\327k\202\355Ky_\201\3176\304_z\343\037\307\021L254\n9\330\206\002\353\273\320)\232\267/s\234\002\313\254\034\333\311\342\tFT\323}\375AI\276\346\333Cm\347m:\026\343\022\003\341\276\r\314]\204s\035\220\334\212\036\361A7X\217y\032BT\025\304\205\335\tKG\036\322\276\270C\277[\270\033&8B\270*\023\017\017:M\271\222\002\037\251\250:I\320C\247\300\260Hw\252\246?\356\361\v\225\340\205\036\271\257Zc\346\177R\231\364\026\351\236\252\227j}\022\204\177\305\f\256\003-g\326\037\345\327\334\274-{\353jE\221\036z\024\241.<\003\353\314D\233\271u\202\314\001\301\352\223\023\2711g\364/\367\035\226\373\230\367b\\\361\266\366b\001U\216-u\345\f\251\242\351\271Xh\317v\306\t\r\320\000\2139\302\226\034H\275\016\370b\254{\206%+l\351\234S-\220\377\206{\314\200@\005\017u\261$\271xd\315p\332\267|\320\240\205\032\334\236m~*\335\216:\023\211\0279\3027\344\345\344\037\242U\274\b0\315\205\204l\216\220\376\362\022;\351O\366\223\"\037-\355i\033\273\257\233 \3425b\345q\034\347Dq\363\006\236\005\370\322\363\354\236\b\233U\342Q\322\307\222#\331Fn\036\252m\344\244l\0312\356\312\227\365;\364\313\335\331Y\017Lw\201\001 \330\220\370\330@\235z\254uO\256\247\000\313\25