  checkpoint {
    session_summary: "<summary>\n1. **Task Overview**\n   - **Core Request**: Build and refine a monochrome editorial web portfolio landing page for **Mahesa Rizky Putra** (`Poltekkes Kemenkes Semarang`).\n   - **Current Follow-Up Request**:\n     1. Update the 3D Lanyard ID Card in the `About` section (`#about`) to match the uploaded reference video (`/public/assets/aistudio/ssstik.io_1792737200017_f17776d8.mp4`):\n        - The top end of the lanyard strap must be anchored at the **top-right edge of the `About` section** (`ujung lanyard berada di atas kanan halaman About untuk mengisi space dari deskripsi`), hanging directly on the page background (no dark boxed container around it).\n        - When entering the `About` section, the lanyard must **drop down from the top** under gravity (`pada saat memasuki halaman about, lanyard akan jatuh dari atas`).\n        - Remove any helper buttons (`Ayunkan` / `Putar 360\302\260` / header bar) \342\200\224 interaction should be purely dragging/moving the lanyard card with the mouse (`cukup hanya lanyard bisa di interkasi dengan digerakkan menggunakan mouse`).\n     2. Remove the location label (`Semarang, Jawa Tengah, Indonesia` and its icon) from the `About` section header (`untuk keterangan lokasi semarang, jawa tengah, indonesia dihapus saja`).\n\n2. **Progress**\n   - **Completed Previously & Verified**:\n     - `/metadata.json`, `/index.html`, `/src/index.css`: Configured title, fonts (`Outfit`, `Plus Jakarta Sans`, `JetBrains Mono`), marquee keyframes, and outlined stroke text styles.\n     - `/src/data/portfolioData.ts`: Structured portfolio data for Mahesa using his latest original-color portrait `/assets/aistudio/3d152b29-5eee-41c9-91fe-5416a9a09854_23a27462.png`.\n     - `/src/components/Navbar.tsx`: Persistent **Liquid Glass** top navigation bar (`Mahesa` - `About` - `Experience` - `Competencies` - `Certification` - `Projects` - `Contact Me`).\n     - `/src/components/HeroSection.tsx`: Clean hero section with Mahesa\'s original-color portrait in front of the giant running `PORTOFOLIO` marquee text and vertical `SCROLL DOWN` button.\n     - `/src/App.tsx`: Custom `requestAnimationFrame` (`easeInOutCubic`) smooth-scrolling engine when clicking navigation links.\n     - `/src/components/ExperienceSection.tsx`, `/src/components/CompetenciesSection.tsx`, `/src/components/CertificationSection.tsx`, `/src/components/ProjectsSection.tsx`, `/src/components/ContactSection.tsx`: Complete interactive portfolio sections.\n   - **Completed Code Edits in This Turn (Awaiting Verification)**:\n     - `/src/utils/lanyardPhysics.ts` & `/src/utils/lanyardPhysics.test.ts`: Updated `createLanyardPhysicsState()` so free nodes `[1..4]` start above `anchorY = 4.65` and drop down under gravity, plus added `resetLanyardDrop(state)` triggered when entering `#about`.\n     - `/src/components/Lanyard3DCard.tsx`: Removed the dark bordered container box, top header text, and bottom `Ayunkan`/`Putar 360\302\260` buttons; made the WebGL canvas transparent (`alpha: true`); added `IntersectionObserver` to trigger `resetLanyardDrop` on entering `#about`; styled the 3D card face to match the reference video (full-bleed portrait, dark bottom vignette, stylized `Mahesa` signature script, `MAHESA RIZKY PUTRA I.`, `POLTEKKES SEMARANG`).\n     - `/src/components/AboutSection.tsx`: Removed the `Semarang, Jawa Tengah, Indonesia` location indicator and positioned `<Lanyard3DCard />` in the right column (`lg:col-span-5 -mt-12 sm:-mt-20 lg:-mt-28`) so the top of the lanyard strap meets the top border of the `#about` section alongside the heading and description.\n\n3. **Key Findings**\n   - The reference video (`/public/assets/aistudio/ssstik.io_1792737200017_f17776d8.mp4`) shows the 3D lanyard hanging directly over the section background from the top edge on the right side (without an enclosing card box), dropping from above on entry, and featuring a dark portrait badge with a stylized script signature at the bottom.\n   - Headless Chromium uses software WebGL (`SwiftShader`), so `Lanyard3DCard.tsx` uses the `afterDraw(tick)` synchronization pattern from the `threejs` skill to ensure `playwright-cli screenshot` never times out.\n\n4. **Active Context**\n   - All code modifications for the current user request have been written to `/src/utils/lanyardPhysics.ts`, `/src/utils/lanyardPhysics.test.ts`, `/src/components/Lanyard3DCard.tsx`, and `/src/components/AboutSection.tsx`.\n   - Unit tests, compilation (`compile_applet`), dev server restart (`restart_dev_server`), and the post-edit browser verification check in `playwright-cli` have not been run yet for this latest edit.\n\n5. **Next Steps**\n   1. Run unit tests via `run_command`: `npx tsx --test src/utils/portfolioLogic.test.ts src/utils/lanyardPhysics.test.ts`.\n   2. Run `compile_applet` to verify zero TypeScript/build errors.\n   3. Run `restart_dev_server` so the running server serves the latest code (`DISABLE_HMR=true`).\n   4. Run a single targeted verification check in `playwright-cli` (`open http://localhost:3000`, `resize 1440 900`, click `About` link `e9`, wait ~1.8s for the lanyard drop animation to settle, take screenshot `.playwright-cli/followup-lanyard-frameless.png`, check `console`, and trap `playwright-cli close` on EXIT).\n   5. View `/.playwright-cli/followup-lanyard-frameless.png` via `view_file` to confirm the lanyard strap attaches cleanly to the top-right of `#about`, the card hangs beside the description with no control buttons or box, and `Semarang, Jawa Tengah, Indonesia` is gone.\n   6. Present a concise summary in Indonesian to the user.\n\n6. **Commitments & Constraints**\n   - Skills already read and active: `ultra-mode`, `frontend-design`, `computer-use`, `focus-mode`, `threejs`.\n   - Follow `ultra-mode` verification discipline: always run unit tests, `compile_applet`, `restart_dev_server`, and inspect the browser capture after the final edit before responding to the user.\n</summary>"
    included_step_index_end: 209
    user_requests: "Here is the full initial file tree for the application:\n/.env.example\n/.gitignore\n/index.html\n/metadata.json\n/package.json\n/src/App.tsx\n/src/index.css\n/src/main.tsx\n/tsconfig.json\n/vite.config.ts\n\nThe following dependencies are installed:\n@google/genai: ^2.4.0\n@tailwindcss/vite: ^4.3.3\n@vitejs/plugin-react: ^6.1.1\ndotenv: ^17.2.3\nexpress: ^4.21.2\nlucide-react: ^0.546.0\nmotion: ^12.23.24\nreact: ^19.0.1\nreact-dom: ^19.0.1\nvite: ^8.3.0\n\nThe following devDependencies are installed:\n@types/express: ^4.17.21\n@types/node: ^22.14.0\n@types/react: ^19.3.0\n@types/react-dom: ^19.3.0\nautoprefixer: ^10.4.21\nesbuild: ^0.25.0\ntailwindcss: ^4.3.3\ntsx: ^4.21.0\ntypescript: ^7.0.2\n\nKey file contents:\n\n--- /.env.example ---\n```\n# GEMINI_API_KEY: Required for Gemini AI API calls.\n# AI Studio automatically injects this at runtime from user secrets.\n# Users configure this via the Secrets panel in the AI Studio UI.\nGEMINI_API_KEY=\"MY_GEMINI_API_KEY\"\n\n# APP_URL: The URL where this applet is hosted.\n# AI Studio automatically injects this at runtime with the Cloud Run service URL.\n# Used for self-referential links, OAuth callbacks, and API endpoints.\nAPP_URL=\"MY_APP_URL\"\n\n```\n\n--- /index.html ---\n```html\n<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n  <head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\" />\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\" />\n    <title>My Google AI Studio App</title>\n    <meta name=\"description\" content=\"An application built with Google AI Studio.\" />\n    <meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"My Google AI Studio App\" />\n    <meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"An application built with Google AI Studio.\" />\n    <meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"website\" />\n    <meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\" />\n  </head>\n  <body>\n    <div id=\"root\"></div>\n    <script type=\"module\" src=\"/src/main.tsx\"></script>\n  </body>\n</html>\n\n\n```\n\n--- /metadata.json ---\n```json\n{\n  \"name\": \"\",\n  \"description\": \"\",\n  \"requestFramePermissions\": [],\n  \"majorCapabilities\": [\"MAJOR_CAPABILITY_SERVER_SIDE_GEMINI_API\"]\n}\n\n```\n\n--- /src/App.tsx ---\n```typescript\n/**\n * @license\n * SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0\n */\n\nexport default function App() {\n  return <div></div>;\n}\n\n```\n\n--- /src/index.css ---\n```css\n@import \"tailwindcss\";\n\n```\n\n--- /src/main.tsx ---\n```typescript\nimport {createRoot} from \'react-dom/client\';\nimport App from \'./App.tsx\';\nimport \'./index.css\';\n\ncreateRoot(document.getElementById(\'root\')!).render(<App />);\n\n```\n\n--- /tsconfig.json ---\n```json\n{\n  \"compilerOptions\": {\n    \"target\": \"ES2022\",\n    \"experimentalDecorators\": true,\n    \"useDefineForClassFields\": false,\n    \"module\": \"ESNext\",\n    \"types\": [\"vite/client\"],\n    \"lib\": [\n      \"ES2022\",\n      \"DOM\",\n      \"DOM.Iterable\"\n    ],\n    \"skipLibCheck\": true,\n    \"moduleResolution\": \"bundler\",\n    \"isolatedModules\": true,\n    \"moduleDetection\": \"force\",\n    \"allowJs\": true,\n    \"jsx\": \"react-jsx\",\n    \"paths\": {\n      \"@/*\": [\n        \"./*\"\n      ]\n    },\n    \"allowImportingTsExtensions\": true,\n    \"noEmit\": true\n  },\n  \"exclude\": [\"dist\"]\n}\n\n```\n\n--- /vite.config.ts ---\n```typescript\nimport tailwindcss from \'@tailwindcss/vite\';\nimport react from \'@vitejs/plugin-react\';\nimport path from \'path\';\nimport {defineConfig} from \'vite\';\n\nexport default defineConfig(() => {\n  return {\n    plugins: [react(), tailwindcss()],\n    resolve: {\n      alias: {\n        \'@\': path.resolve(__dirname, \'.\'),\n      },\n    },\n    server: {\n      // HMR is disabled in AI Studio via DISABLE_HMR env var.\n      // Do not modify\342\200\224file watching is disabled to prevent flickering during agent edits.\n      hmr: process.env.DISABLE_HMR !== \'true\',\n      // Disable file watching when DISABLE_HMR is true to save CPU during agent edits.\n      watch: process.env.DISABLE_HMR === \'true\' ? null : {},\n    },\n  };\n});\n\n```"
    user_requests: "saya disini ingin membuat portofolio berbasi web landing page. saya ingin membuatnya di google ai studio.\n\ndimulai dari home pagenya. file image.png yang saya kirim adalah referensi untuk tampilan awal pada porto saya. menampilkan foto saya (porto.png) dan dibelakangnya terdapat teks berjalan bertuliskan PORTOFOLIO. saya ingin background dengan tema monokrom hitam putih namun tetap elegan.\n\nuntuk bar navigasi saya ingin tetap ada jika berlanjut pada page selanjutnya. isi dari bar navigasi adalah mulai dari pojok kiri; Mahesa - About - Experience - Competencies - Certification - Projects - Contact Me(ini untuk tombol di sebelah kanan). bar navigasi saya ingin seperti glass effect. dengan animasi hover halus saat kursor diarahkan ke setiap menu.\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_START]\nMedia attachment: User sent attachment: /assets/aistudio/image_66361083.png (saved in workspace at /public/assets/aistudio/image_66361083.png). Read it with view_file at that path; in shell commands, which run from the workspace root, use the relative path public/assets/aistudio/image_66361083.png. When displaying or embedding this asset in code, reference this local file path directly. Only invoke image generation tools if the user explicitly requests creating or modifying an image.\n  User sent attachment: /assets/aistudio/porto_31e92968.png (saved in workspace at /public/assets/aistudio/porto_31e92968.png). Read it with view_file at that path; in shell commands, which run from the workspace root, use the relative path public/assets/aistudio/porto_31e92968.png. When displaying or embedding this asset in code, reference this local file path directly. Only invoke image generation tools if the user explicitly requests creating or modifying an image.\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_END]"
