    session_summary: "<summary>\n1. **Task Overview**\n   - We are building and refining a monochrome personal portfolio web application for **Mahesa Rizky Putra Irdiansyah** (D3 Rekam Medis dan Informasi Kesehatan, Poltekkes Kemenkes Semarang).\n   - In the latest turn (Focus Mode), the user selected two elements inside the PDF Viewer Modal header (`div#root:nth-of-type(1) > div:nth-of-type(1) > main:nth-of-type(1) > section#about:nth-of-type(2) > div:nth-of-type(2) > div:nth-of-type(1) > div:nth-of-type(1) > div:nth-of-type(1) > div:nth-of-type(2) > p:nth-of-type(1)` and `h3#cv-modal-title:nth-of-type(1)`) in `/src/components/PdfViewerModal.tsx` and requested: **\"hapus saja\"** (delete those two text elements from the PDF viewer modal header).\n\n2. **Progress**\n   - **Completed in previous turns**:\n     - Full-bleed unclipped 3D Lanyard ID Card in `/src/components/Lanyard3DCard.tsx` and `/src/utils/lanyardPhysics.ts` spanning 100% of the `#about` section width so dragging left/right never clips inside a box.\n     - Updated card text below \"Mahesa\" signature to `\"Perekam Medis dan Informasi Kesehatan\"` and removed all text below it.\n     - Updated `#about-heading` in `/src/components/AboutSection.tsx` to `ABOUT ME`.\n     - Updated `PROFILE_DATA.bioLead`, `PROFILE_DATA.bioParagraphs`, and `PROFILE_DATA.metrics` in `/src/data/portfolioData.ts` (4-column horizontal row: `5 Lokasi Praktik`, `3,79 IPK Akademik`, `HOT-FIT Evaluasi RME`, `SIMRS Pengalaman Sistem`).\n     - Created `/src/components/ButtonColorful.tsx` and applied it to the `Ringkasan Curriculum Vitae` button in `/src/components/AboutSection.tsx`.\n     - Installed `pdfjs-dist` and created `/src/components/PdfViewerModal.tsx` to render `/assets/aistudio/CV_ATS_7ce604eb.pdf` (located at `/public/assets/aistudio/CV_ATS_7ce604eb.pdf`) directly onto `<canvas>` pages with zoom and download controls.\n   - **In Progress**:\n     - We just viewed `/src/components/PdfViewerModal.tsx` lines 100\342\200\223160 and identified lines 137\342\200\223148 containing the `<p>` (`CURRICULUM VITAE \302\267 2 HALAMAN`) and `<h3 id=\"cv-modal-title\">` (`{title}`) that the user selected to delete.\n\n3. **Key Findings**\n   - Software WebGL (`SwiftShader`) is used in headless Chromium; `Lanyard3DCard.tsx` already includes the `afterDraw` fenceSync throttle and `computeWorldAnchorX` to position the lanyard in the right column space while keeping the canvas full-width.\n   - `pdfjs-dist` v5+ requires `pdfjsLib.getDocument({ data: arrayBuffer })` (already implemented in `/src/components/PdfViewerModal.tsx`).\n   - Two temporary Ghostscript PNG files (`public/assets/aistudio/cv_page_1.png` and `public/assets/aistudio/cv_page_2.png`) were created earlier and can be removed via `rm -f public/assets/aistudio/cv_page_*.png` in `run_command` if desired (`delete_file` failed on binary PNGs).\n\n4. **Active Context**\n   - `/src/components/PdfViewerModal.tsx` lines 126\342\200\223150 currently render:\n     ```tsx\n        {/* Top Toolbar */}\n        <div className=\"flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 pb-4 border-b border-current/10 shrink-0\">\n          <div className=\"flex items-center gap-3\">\n            <div\n              className={`w-10 h-10 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center border ${\n                darkMode\n                  ? \'bg-zinc-800 border-white/10 text-zinc-100\'\n                  : \'bg-zinc-100 border-zinc-900/10 text-zinc-900\'\n              }`}\n            >\n              <FileText className=\"w-5 h-5\" />\n            </div>\n            <div>\n              <p className=\"font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-widest opacity-60\">\n                CURRICULUM VITAE \302\267{\' \'}\n                {numPages > 0 ? `${numPages} HALAMAN` : \'PDF VIEWER\'}\n              </p>\n              <h3\n                id=\"cv-modal-title\"\n                className=\"font-display font-bold text-base sm:text-lg\"\n              >\n                {title}\n              </h3>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n     ```\n   - Removing the `<div>` containing `<p>` and `<h3 id=\"cv-modal-title\">` (and replacing `aria-labelledby=\"cv-modal-title\"` with `aria-label=\"Curriculum Vitae PDF Viewer\"` on the dialog container) will fulfill the user\'s Focus Mode request cleanly.\n\n5. **Next Steps**\n   1. Perform Skill Check (`focus-mode`, `ultra-mode`, `computer-use`, `frontend-design` \342\200\224 already read, or call `view_file` on their `SKILL.md` if not in the new context window).\n   2. Use `replace_file_content` on `/src/components/PdfViewerModal.tsx` to remove the `<p>` (`CURRICULUM VITAE \302\267 ...`) and `<h3 id=\"cv-modal-title\">` (`{title}`) elements from the modal header.\n   3. Run `compile_applet` and `restart_dev_server`.\n   4. Verify in headless Chromium via `playwright-cli` by opening the CV modal and inspecting a screenshot (`view_file`), then reply concisely in Indonesian.\n\n6. **Commitments & Constraints**\n   - Adhere strictly to Focus Mode rules (only remove the targeted elements).\n   - Always close `playwright-cli` in the same `run_command` invocation (`trap \"playwright-cli close >/dev/null 2>&1 || true\" EXIT`).\n   - Respond in Indonesian.\n</summary>"
    included_step_index_start: 209
    included_step_index_end: 346
