  user_input {
    user_response: "buatkan ulang halaman Experience dengan konfigurasi 5 buah hasil pengalaman saya.\n\npengalaman 1\n\nEXPERIENCE DATA:\n- Title: Praktik Kerja Nyata (PKN) \342\200\224 Pelayanan dan Informasi Kesehatan\n- Institution: Puskesmas Poncol\n- Period: Januari\342\200\223Februari 2026\n- Category: Primary Healthcare\n- Location: Semarang, Indonesia\n\nVERIFIED ACTIVITIES:\nMy activities included:\n- Bertugas di bagian pendaftaran pasien.\n- Melakukan penyuluhan mengenai jentik nyamuk.\n- Terlibat dalam kegiatan Program Pengelolaan Penyakit Kronis (Prolanis).\n- Mengikuti kegiatan di Puskesmas Pembantu (Pustu).\n- Mengikuti kegiatan Cek Kesehatan Gratis (CKG) di sekolah-sekolah.\n\nCONTENT REQUIREMENTS:\n- Write a concise, professional Indonesian summary highlighting primary healthcare services, patient registration, health information workflows, and community health activities.\n- Organize the contribution list into no more than 3 meaningful items:\n  1. Pelayanan pendaftaran dan dukungan alur administrasi pasien.\n  2. Partisipasi dalam program kesehatan masyarakat, termasuk penyuluhan jentik dan Prolanis.\n  3. Dukungan kegiatan pelayanan di Pustu serta CKG di sekolah.\n- Preserve the distinction between activities I participated in and activities I independently led.\n- Do not claim that I diagnosed patients, provided clinical treatment, led a program, or achieved measurable health outcomes unless documented.\n- Do not invent patient counts or performance metrics.\n\nDESIGN REQUIREMENTS:\n- Update only the sixth Experience card.\n- Preserve the existing card layout, dark editorial styling, responsive behavior, and expand/collapse interaction.\n- Store the content in the existing portfolio data structure.\n- Do not modify other cards or page sections.\n\n\npengalaman 2\n\nEXPERIENCE DATA:\n- Title: Praktik Kerja Lapangan (PKL) \342\200\224 Rekam Medis\n- Institution: RSUD Bagas Waras Klaten\n- Period: Oktober\342\200\223November 2025\n- Category: Academic & Clinical\n- Location: Klaten, Indonesia\n\nCONTENT REQUIREMENTS:\n- Use professional Indonesian language.\n- Emphasize my development in medical records and health information management through hospital-based practical training.\n- Include only duties and contributions supported by existing project data.\n- If the actual duties are unavailable, use editable placeholders for me to complete later.\n- Do not invent system names, coding assignments, patient counts, productivity figures, or measurable impacts.\n- Provide a concise summary and up to 3 contribution items.\n\nDESIGN REQUIREMENTS:\n- Update only the fourth Experience card.\n- Keep the existing typography, dark background, card borders, spacing, and expand/collapse behavior.\n- Keep all existing application functionality intact.\n- Do not rewrite the other Experience cards or unrelated files.\n\n\npengalaman 3 \n\nEXPERIENCE DATA:\n- Title: Praktik Kerja Lapangan (PKL) \342\200\224 Rekam Medis\n- Institution: RSUD Gondo Suwarno Ungaran\n- Period: April\342\200\223Mei 2025\n- Category: Academic & Clinical\n- Location: Ungaran, Indonesia\n\nCONTENT REQUIREMENTS:\n- Present this experience as part of my academic development in Medical Records and Health Information Management.\n- Write a concise Indonesian summary focused on hospital medical records operations and health information workflows.\n- Use actual duties from the existing portfolio data only.\n- If detailed activities are missing, create editable placeholders for the summary and up to 3 contribution items.\n- Do not fabricate responsibilities, achievements, quantitative outcomes, or claims of independently managing hospital systems.\n\nDESIGN REQUIREMENTS:\n- Modify only the third Experience card\'s content.\n- Preserve the existing dark editorial card design and all interactions.\n- Reuse the existing data model and components.\n- Do not modify other cards, page sections, or navigation.\n\n\npengalaman 4\n\nEXPERIENCE DATA:\n- Title: Praktik Kerja Lapangan (PKL) \342\200\224 Rekam Medis\n- Institution: RS PKU Muhammadiyah Wonosobo\n- Period: Oktober\342\200\223November 2024\n- Category: Academic & Clinical\n- Location: Wonosobo, Indonesia\n\nCONTENT REQUIREMENTS:\n- Write professional Indonesian content relevant to hospital medical records and health information management.\n- Use only duties supported by my existing data.\n- Do not assume that I performed coding, assembling, filing, reporting, registration, or other specific tasks unless the existing project data confirms them.\n- If my actual duties are not documented, add editable placeholders for the summary and up to 3 contribution items.\n- Do not invent numerical achievements or operational performance metrics.\n\nDESIGN REQUIREMENTS:\n- Update only the second Experience card.\n- Preserve the existing visual style, card structure, typography, dark theme, and expand/collapse interaction.\n- Use the current portfolio data model.\n- Do not change the other five cards or any other page section.\n\n\npengalaman 5\n\nUpdate the first Experience card in my existing portfolio.\n\nEXPERIENCE DATA:\n- Title: Praktik Kerja Lapangan (PKL) \342\200\224 Rekam Medis\n- Institution: RSUD dr. Loekmono Hadi Kudus\n- Period: Mei\342\200\223Juni 2024\n- Category: Academic & Clinical\n- Location: Kudus, Indonesia\n\nCONTENT REQUIREMENTS:\n- Write the summary in professional Indonesian.\n- Focus on learning and exposure to medical records operations in a hospital environment.\n- In the Contributions section, include only duties that are already documented in my project data.\n- If specific duties are unavailable, use an editable placeholder asking me to provide the actual activities. Do not invent duties, achievements, patient volumes, or performance metrics.\n- Use a concise title, a 1\342\200\2232 sentence summary, and up to 3 contribution items.\n- Do not display unsupported numerical impact metrics.\n\nDESIGN REQUIREMENTS:\n- Update only the data for the first Experience card.\n- Preserve the existing card layout, typography, dark theme, borders, expand/collapse interaction, and responsive behavior.\n- Keep the period and institution visible.\n- Do not modify other Experience cards or other sections.\n- Store the content in the existing portfolio data structure rather than hardcoding duplicate JSX."
    items {
      text: "buatkan ulang halaman Experience dengan konfigurasi 5 buah hasil pengalaman saya.\n\npengalaman 1\n\nEXPERIENCE DATA:\n- Title: Praktik Kerja Nyata (PKN) \342\200\224 Pelayanan dan Informasi Kesehatan\n- Institution: Puskesmas Poncol\n- Period: Januari\342\200\223Februari 2026\n- Category: Primary Healthcare\n- Location: Semarang, Indonesia\n\nVERIFIED ACTIVITIES:\nMy activities included:\n- Bertugas di bagian pendaftaran pasien.\n- Melakukan penyuluhan mengenai jentik nyamuk.\n- Terlibat dalam kegiatan Program Pengelolaan Penyakit Kronis (Prolanis).\n- Mengikuti kegiatan di Puskesmas Pembantu (Pustu).\n- Mengikuti kegiatan Cek Kesehatan Gratis (CKG) di sekolah-sekolah.\n\nCONTENT REQUIREMENTS:\n- Write a concise, professional Indonesian summary highlighting primary healthcare services, patient registration, health information workflows, and community health activities.\n- Organize the contribution list into no more than 3 meaningful items:\n  1. Pelayanan pendaftaran dan dukungan alur administrasi pasien.\n  2. Partisipasi dalam program kesehatan masyarakat, termasuk penyuluhan jentik dan Prolanis.\n  3. Dukungan kegiatan pelayanan di Pustu serta CKG di sekolah.\n- Preserve the distinction between activities I participated in and activities I independently led.\n- Do not claim that I diagnosed patients, provided clinical treatment, led a program, or achieved measurable health outcomes unless documented.\n- Do not invent patient counts or performance metrics.\n\nDESIGN REQUIREMENTS:\n- Update only the sixth Experience card.\n- Preserve the existing card layout, dark editorial styling, responsive behavior, and expand/collapse interaction.\n- Store the content in the existing portfolio data structure.\n- Do not modify other cards or page sections.\n\n\npengalaman 2\n\nEXPERIENCE DATA:\n- Title: Praktik Kerja Lapangan (PKL) \342\200\224 Rekam Medis\n- Institution: RSUD Bagas Waras Klaten\n- Period: Oktober\342\200\223November 2025\n- Category: Academic & Clinical\n- Location: Klaten, Indonesia\n\nCONTENT REQUIREMENTS:\n- Use professional Indonesian language.\n- Emphasize my development in medical records and health information management through hospital-based practical training.\n- Include only duties and contributions supported by existing project data.\n- If the actual duties are unavailable, use editable placeholders for me to complete later.\n- Do not invent system names, coding assignments, patient counts, productivity figures, or measurable impacts.\n- Provide a concise summary and up to 3 contribution items.\n\nDESIGN REQUIREMENTS:\n- Update only the fourth Experience card.\n- Keep the existing typography, dark background, card borders, spacing, and expand/collapse behavior.\n- Keep all existing application functionality intact.\n- Do not rewrite the other Experience cards or unrelated files.\n\n\npengalaman 3 \n\nEXPERIENCE DATA:\n- Title: Praktik Kerja Lapangan (PKL) \342\200\224 Rekam Medis\n- Institution: RSUD Gondo Suwarno Ungaran\n- Period: April\342\200\223Mei 2025\n- Category: Academic & Clinical\n- Location: Ungaran, Indonesia\n\nCONTENT REQUIREMENTS:\n- Present this experience as part of my academic development in Medical Records and Health Information Management.\n- Write a concise Indonesian summary focused on hospital medical records operations and health information workflows.\n- Use actual duties from the existing portfolio data only.\n- If detailed activities are missing, create editable placeholders for the summary and up to 3 contribution items.\n- Do not fabricate responsibilities, achievements, quantitative outcomes, or claims of independently managing hospital systems.\n\nDESIGN REQUIREMENTS:\n- Modify only the third Experience card\'s content.\n- Preserve the existing dark editorial card design and all interactions.\n- Reuse the existing data model and components.\n- Do not modify other cards, page sections, or navigation.\n\n\npengalaman 4\n\nEXPERIENCE DATA:\n- Title: Praktik Kerja Lapangan (PKL) \342\200\224 Rekam Medis\n- Institution: RS PKU Muhammadiyah Wonosobo\n- Period: Oktober\342\200\223November 2024\n- Category: Academic & Clinical\n- Location: Wonosobo, Indonesia\n\nCONTENT REQUIREMENTS:\n- Write professional Indonesian content relevant to hospital medical records and health information management.\n- Use only duties supported by my existing data.\n- Do not assume that I performed coding, assembling, filing, reporting, registration, or other specific tasks unless the existing project data confirms them.\n- If my actual duties are not documented, add editable placeholders for the summary and up to 3 contribution items.\n- Do not invent numerical achievements or operational performance metrics.\n\nDESIGN REQUIREMENTS:\n- Update only the second Experience card.\n- Preserve the existing visual style, card structure, typography, dark theme, and expand/collapse interaction.\n- Use the current portfolio data model.\n- Do not change the other five cards or any other page section.\n\n\npengalaman 5\n\nUpdate the first Experience card in my existing portfolio.\n\nEXPERIENCE DATA:\n- Title: Praktik Kerja Lapangan (PKL) \342\200\224 Rekam Medis\n- Institution: RSUD dr. Loekmono Hadi Kudus\n- Period: Mei\342\200\223Juni 2024\n- Category: Academic & Clinical\n- Location: Kudus, Indonesia\n\nCONTENT REQUIREMENTS:\n- Write the summary in professional Indonesian.\n- Focus on learning and exposure to medical records operations in a hospital environment.\n- In the Contributions section, include only duties that are already documented in my project data.\n- If specific duties are unavailable, use an editable placeholder asking me to provide the actual activities. Do not invent duties, achievements, patient volumes, or performance metrics.\n- Use a concise title, a 1\342\200\2232 sentence summary, and up to 3 contribution items.\n- Do not display unsupported numerical impact metrics.\n\nDESIGN REQUIREMENTS:\n- Update only the data for the first Experience card.\n- Preserve the existing card layout, typography, dark theme, borders, expand/collapse interaction, and responsive behavior.\n- Keep the period and institution visible.\n- Do not modify other Experience cards or other sections.\n- Store the content in the existing portfolio data structure rather than hardcoding duplicate JSX."
    }
  }
}
