pengalaman 3 (RSUD Gondo Suwarno Ungaran) using a concise academic focus, crafting a 1-2 sentence summary, and incorporating the 3 editable placeholder items for highlights. I am now working on experience 4 (RS PKU Muhammadiyah Wonosobo) in the same vein. I\'m prioritizing the placeholder items by focusing on the 3 required editable entries and the provided content.\n\n\n**Finalizing Entry Highlights**\n\nI\'m now completing the highlights for experience 4 (RS PKU Muhammadiyah Wonosobo). I\'m focusing on incorporating the three editable placeholders for duties, health information management activities, and field learning. Next I am focusing on entry 5 (RSUD dr. Loekmono Hadi Kudus), implementing the same structure, focusing on the learning and exposure to medical record operations and incorporating placeholders for details of the actual activities, operational support, and specific tasks.\n\n\n**Refining Category Filters**\n\nI\'m now integrating the updated category filters in `/src/components/ExperienceSection.tsx`. I have updated the `CATEGORIES` array to include \'Academic & Clinical\' and \'Primary Healthcare\'. I\'m also modifying the component to prevent rendering an empty span when `exp.metrics` is empty and will adapt the heading to \"Kontribusi & Kegiatan\" when non-metric-focused.\n\n\\n\\n\n\n**Verifying Filter Functionality**\n\nI\'m now confirming the filter logic works in `/src/utils/portfolioLogic.test.ts`, reviewing and correcting the testing of the updated category filters. I will now run tests to make sure that filtering works accurately by category. I want to check that the category filters applied to experience entries are correct, and update the test case to accurately reflect the changes.\n\n\n"
