  checkpoint {
    checkpoint_index: 2
    session_summary: "<summary>\n1. **Task Overview**\n   - **Core Request**: Update the titles of the 5 Experience cards in the `#experience` section (`My Experience`) so that:\n     - `Praktik Kerja Nyata (PKN) \342\200\224 Pelayanan dan Informasi Kesehatan` is changed to `Praktik Kerja Nyata (PKN) - Puskesmas Poncol`, and the `Puskesmas Poncol` subtitle line below it is removed.\n     - `Praktik Kerja Lapangan (PKL) \342\200\224 Rekam Medis` on the 4 hospital PKL cards is changed to `Praktik Kerja Lapangan (PKL) - <Nama RS>` (`RSUD Bagas Waras Klaten`, `RSUD Gondo Suwarno Ungaran`, `RS PKU Muhammadiyah Wonosobo`, `RSUD dr. Loekmono Hadi Kudus`), and the duplicate hospital name subtitle line below each title is removed.\n   - **Success Criteria**: All 5 Experience cards display the updated titles with no duplicate institution subtitle line underneath, all unit tests pass, and the applet compiles and runs cleanly.\n\n2. **Progress**\n   - **Completed**:\n     - Updated `/src/data/portfolioData.ts` (`EXPERIENCE_DATA` items `exp-01` through `exp-05`) so each `role` is formatted as `Praktik Kerja Nyata (PKN) - Puskesmas Poncol` or `Praktik Kerja Lapangan (PKL) - <Nama RS>`, and set `organization: \'\'` on all 5 items.\n     - Updated `/src/components/ExperienceSection.tsx` so `<p className=\"text-sm font-medium opacity-80\">{exp.organization}</p>` only renders when `exp.organization` is truthy (`{exp.organization && (...)}`), and simplified the expand button `aria-label` to `${exp.role}`.\n   - **In Progress / Remaining**:\n     - Run unit tests (`./node_modules/.bin/tsx --test src/utils/*.test.ts`), `compile_applet`, and `restart_dev_server` to verify the changes and provide the final Indonesian response to the user.\n\n3. **Key Findings**\n   - This is a text/content adjustment to the Experience cards (`ultra-mode` proportional verification applies: unit tests + compilation check are sufficient without needing a full browser screenshot loop).\n   - Previously completed in this session:\n     - Default theme set to dark mode (`darkMode = true` in `/src/App.tsx`, `class=\"scroll-smooth dark\"` and `bg-[#0B0B0D]` in `/index.html`) while keeping the theme toggle button in `/src/components/Navbar.tsx`.\n     - Removed `02 \302\267 Rekam Jejak & Pengalaman` subtitle and changed `#experience-heading` to `My Experience` in `/src/components/ExperienceSection.tsx`.\n     - Configured `EXPERIENCE_DATA` in `/src/data/portfolioData.ts` with the 5 requested experiences and updated `/src/utils/portfolioLogic.test.ts` accordingly.\n\n4. **Active Context**\n   - Dev server is running on `http://localhost:3000`.\n   - All code edits for the current user request are already applied to `/src/data/portfolioData.ts` and `/src/components/ExperienceSection.tsx`.\n\n5. **Next Steps**\n   1. Run `./node_modules/.bin/tsx --test src/utils/*.test.ts` via `run_command`.\n   2. Run `compile_applet` and `restart_dev_server`.\n   3. Reply concisely in Indonesian confirming the Experience card titles and removal of the institution subtitle lines below them.\n\n6. **Commitments & Constraints**\n   - Communicate with the user in Indonesian.\n   - Maintain the dark editorial theme as the default and preserve all existing card interactions, borders, and layout.\n</summary>"
    included_step_index_start: 284
    included_step_index_end: 350
